(4556682, 657062, 61552, '<td valign="top">Ahhhhh, a little "Praying to the Porcelain God"!  Good photo, but maybe not quite a blurry mess.  Almost looks like a painting.</td>', 'Ahhhhh, a little "Praying to the Porcelain God"!  Good photo, but maybe not quite a blurry mess.  Almost looks like a painting.', '2008-03-12 00:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
