(4556929, 656084, 90394, '<td valign="top">Blurry, kinda messy, from the aspect that you have no control of how the raindrops are gonna refract the light. Elements of chaos are inherent, but I''m not overtly engaged  or interested in looking at raindrops, or how the light frags through them. I actually like the bit of focus on the dripping rain, but I think some will be like - ah hah!!! It''s focused!!! You know the types... A good picture.</td>', 'Blurry, kinda messy, from the aspect that you have no control of how the raindrops are gonna refract the light. Elements of chaos are inherent, but I''m not overtly engaged  or interested in looking at raindrops, or how the light frags through them. I actually like the bit of focus on the dripping rain, but I think some will be like - ah hah!!! It''s focused!!! You know the types... A good picture.', '2008-03-12 02:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
