(4558257, 656469, 9494, '<td valign="top">Nice. I love the colors. xxx.</td>', 'Nice. I love the colors. xxx.', '2008-03-12 13:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558259, 656032, 68256, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge very well and is not bad to look at.  Doesn''t apeal to me in any way, but for the challenge it works.  I would have liked it more if the dark blob on the top were yellow to provide some balance or if there were something to keep me inside the photo rather than wondering straight off the top of the frame.</td>', 'Meets the challenge very well and is not bad to look at.  Doesn''t apeal to me in any way, but for the challenge it works.  I would have liked it more if the dark blob on the top were yellow to provide some balance or if there were something to keep me inside the photo rather than wondering straight off the top of the frame.', '2008-03-12 13:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558260, 656316, 81530, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. A well composed photograph that fits the challenge.</td>', 'Nice idea. A well composed photograph that fits the challenge.', '2008-03-12 13:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558261, 657020, 86447, '<td valign="top">I think it all has to be blurry to meet the challenge.   Pretty image though... Would prefer the tree to not distract us from the subject.</td>', 'I think it all has to be blurry to meet the challenge.   Pretty image though... Would prefer the tree to not distract us from the subject.', '2008-03-12 13:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558262, 655890, 90777, '<td valign="top">A longer shutter speed would introduce even more movement into the image and help it look deliberate, rather than a shaky accident. Also if you could crop it so there is more empty space on the left to give the illusion that that is the direction the surfer is going in.  Otherwise a very good attempt at meeting the challenge</td>', 'A longer shutter speed would introduce even more movement into the image and help it look deliberate, rather than a shaky accident. Also if you could crop it so there is more empty space on the left to give the illusion that that is the direction the surfer is going in.  Otherwise a very good attempt at meeting the challenge', '2008-03-12 13:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558264, 656887, 28261, '<td valign="top">not a blurry mess.  It''s blurry, but not very abstract at all.  It has impact and emotion.  I''m not sure if one is going to hit the other or if they are just emotional about what they are talking about.  Nice crop/framing/tilt.  High key works very well here.  Honorable Mention (7) but can''t give you more as there are some fine blurry messes that take higher placement.</td>', 'not a blurry mess.  It''s blurry, but not very abstract at all.  It has impact and emotion.  I''m not sure if one is going to hit the other or if they are just emotional about what they are talking about.  Nice crop/framing/tilt.  High key works very well here.  Honorable Mention (7) but can''t give you more as there are some fine blurry messes that take higher placement.', '2008-03-12 14:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558268, 657046, 68256, '<td valign="top">You definitely got the blurry mess nailed.  I find it strangely interesting too..I like the fact that I''m being sucked in to the center where the light worms are.</td>', 'You definitely got the blurry mess nailed.  I find it strangely interesting too..I like the fact that I''m being sucked in to the center where the light worms are.', '2008-03-12 14:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558269, 656676, 90777, '<td valign="top">A good concept, however it looks like most of the blur was added after the shot, rather than in-camera.</td>', 'A good concept, however it looks like most of the blur was added after the shot, rather than in-camera.', '2008-03-12 14:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558270, 655448, 30982, '<td valign="top">These are always fun shots to take - you never really know what you have until you get home and look.  This is a pretty good attempt, but the whited out part is a tad strong.</td>', 'These are always fun shots to take - you never really know what you have until you get home and look.  This is a pretty good attempt, but the whited out part is a tad strong.', '2008-03-12 14:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558272, 656809, 81530, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea, but unfortunately there isn''t much blurriness inside the washer/dryer. A full load might have worked better.</td>', 'This is a great idea, but unfortunately there isn''t much blurriness inside the washer/dryer. A full load might have worked better.', '2008-03-12 14:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558274, 656082, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice use of zoom to simulate motion in a way.  In this sense, it does indeed add to the picture which I suspect would be a bit bland without it.</td>', 'Nice use of zoom to simulate motion in a way.  In this sense, it does indeed add to the picture which I suspect would be a bit bland without it.', '2008-03-12 14:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558276, 655351, 30982, '<td valign="top">Some may see this as just blurry but the blur does add to the general disorganized feel of a garage.  Though I will say your garage is far too organized... :-)</td>', 'Some may see this as just blurry but the blur does add to the general disorganized feel of a garage.  Though I will say your garage is far too organized... :-)', '2008-03-12 14:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558277, 656663, 81530, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast of the whites and the reds. Nice sense of movement to the center.</td>', 'I love the contrast of the whites and the reds. Nice sense of movement to the center.', '2008-03-12 14:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558279, 657114, 90777, '<td valign="top">I like the red ''tail light waves'' at the bottom of the image</td>', 'I like the red ''tail light waves'' at the bottom of the image', '2008-03-12 14:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558280, 656834, 30982, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.... seems to me your title is providing a hint to the subject of your photo.  An interesting conglomeration though the line in front may be a bit strong and tends to pull the eye.  The mesh texture of it is kinda cool.</td>', 'Hmmm.... seems to me your title is providing a hint to the subject of your photo.  An interesting conglomeration though the line in front may be a bit strong and tends to pull the eye.  The mesh texture of it is kinda cool.', '2008-03-12 14:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558281, 655890, 28261, '<td valign="top">Slightly impressionistic.  Blurry.  Hard to judge because the blur leaves a lower contract factor, but would like to see that contrast in this image.  Feels like I just surfaced and have water on my face/eyes and here comes some guy about to run me down.  Achieves a sense of motion, but the flat lighting fails wow me.<br/>  (5)</td>', 'Slightly impressionistic.  Blurry.  Hard to judge because the blur leaves a lower contract factor, but would like to see that contrast in this image.  Feels like I just surfaced and have water on my face/eyes and here comes some guy about to run me down.  Achieves a sense of motion, but the flat lighting fails wow me.  (5)', '2008-03-12 14:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558282, 656203, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  I like the pixelated noisy nature and the simplicity of the composition.</td>', 'Very cool.  I like the pixelated noisy nature and the simplicity of the composition.', '2008-03-12 14:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558283, 655840, 30982, '<td valign="top">Based on your title, it''s kinda like being at the drive-in without your glasses.</td>', 'Based on your title, it''s kinda like being at the drive-in without your glasses.', '2008-03-12 14:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558284, 657110, 30982, '<td valign="top">A nice delicate abstract.</td>', 'A nice delicate abstract.', '2008-03-12 14:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558285, 657085, 28261, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Shamanistic.  Great colors and overlap of subjects.  Could have been called Peyote.  Makes me feel like finding a bear rug and a sweat lodge.  Perfect crop and presentation.  Abstractly Perfect.  (10)</td>', 'Very nice!  Shamanistic.  Great colors and overlap of subjects.  Could have been called Peyote.  Makes me feel like finding a bear rug and a sweat lodge.  Perfect crop and presentation.  Abstractly Perfect.  (10)', '2008-03-12 14:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558286, 656242, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very fine use of blur both in the bird and the background.</td>', 'Very fine use of blur both in the bird and the background.', '2008-03-12 14:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558287, 656815, 30982, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured what your title indicates very well.  The ghost figures, the moving train, the blurry field of view.</td>', 'You''ve captured what your title indicates very well.  The ghost figures, the moving train, the blurry field of view.', '2008-03-12 14:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558288, 655918, 68256, '<td valign="top">I feel strange voting on these abstracts because I really don''t like that form of art, but I''m going to attempt it anyway!  I think the color pallete is awesome, you''ve met the challenge well and there is some sort of balance to this so you get good marks from me.  I feel no connection to it and no interest at all though (I hope you realize that is a fault of mine and not the photo!).  7</td>', 'I feel strange voting on these abstracts because I really don''t like that form of art, but I''m going to attempt it anyway!  I think the color pallete is awesome, you''ve met the challenge well and there is some sort of balance to this so you get good marks from me.  I feel no connection to it and no interest at all though (I hope you realize that is a fault of mine and not the photo!).  7', '2008-03-12 14:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558290, 656080, 30982, '<td valign="top">A well done and traditional use of blur to give that sunburst sense to flowers.</td>', 'A well done and traditional use of blur to give that sunburst sense to flowers.', '2008-03-12 14:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558291, 656951, 90777, '<td valign="top">I see from the lady''s face that you used a longer shutter speed to introduce blur to the image, however, I feel that a ''shaky'' close up of the sweets(?) next to the cuddly toy or a blurry shot of the colourful bears may have had more impact.</td>', 'I see from the lady''s face that you used a longer shutter speed to introduce blur to the image, however, I feel that a ''shaky'' close up of the sweets(?) next to the cuddly toy or a blurry shot of the colourful bears may have had more impact.', '2008-03-12 14:11:06.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4558292, 656978, 68256, '<td valign="top">Ok, at least there is something to grab hold of here..I have no idea what, but visually it is nice to have that anchor.  The best aspect is the coordinated colors and since of motion.  Great job on this crazy challenge. 8</td>', 'Ok, at least there is something to grab hold of here..I have no idea what, but visually it is nice to have that anchor.  The best aspect is the coordinated colors and since of motion.  Great job on this crazy challenge. 8', '2008-03-12 14:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558293, 656908, 30982, '<td valign="top">Hmmm....   I like the almost space-alienish nature of the figures and the way they''re postrized.  The line cutting across the bottom befuddles me a bit.  Perhaps a rope to drag them down?</td>', 'Hmmm....   I like the almost space-alienish nature of the figures and the way they''re postrized.  The line cutting across the bottom befuddles me a bit.  Perhaps a rope to drag them down?', '2008-03-12 14:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558295, 655313, 30982, '<td valign="top">A soft and gentle use of blur - the butterfly is only barefly there, quietly enjoying its morning.  Really quite lovely.</td>', 'A soft and gentle use of blur - the butterfly is only barefly there, quietly enjoying its morning.  Really quite lovely.', '2008-03-12 14:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558296, 656888, 86447, '<td valign="top">Unless you really DO have Parkinson''s, I think you''ll get some flack for this title...   It''s a pretty image.   I like it.</td>', 'Unless you really DO have Parkinson''s, I think you''ll get some flack for this title...   It''s a pretty image.   I like it.', '2008-03-12 14:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558299, 655712, 90777, '<td valign="top">Good stick jab! good movement, good challenge entry.</td>', 'Good stick jab! good movement, good challenge entry.', '2008-03-12 14:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558300, 656817, 30982, '<td valign="top">A traditional use of blur, nicely done - good color and good sense of both motion and strength.</td>', 'A traditional use of blur, nicely done - good color and good sense of both motion and strength.', '2008-03-12 14:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558301, 656863, 86447, '<td valign="top">Looks sharp to me (sorry for the pun)... not blurry.  Sorry.  DNMC.</td>', 'Looks sharp to me (sorry for the pun)... not blurry.  Sorry.  DNMC.', '2008-03-12 14:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558305, 655583, 90777, '<td valign="top">Steering wheel on wrong side! Can''t see Mr. Sulu.  Great Image.  Like the white lines centralised and the pin sharp dashboard.</td>', 'Steering wheel on wrong side! Can''t see Mr. Sulu.  Great Image.  Like the white lines centralised and the pin sharp dashboard.', '2008-03-12 14:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558308, 657030, 86447, '<td valign="top">I think the entire image has to be blurry to meet the Challenge.</td>', 'I think the entire image has to be blurry to meet the Challenge.', '2008-03-12 14:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558310, 655031, 86447, '<td valign="top">Not blurry, in my opinion.</td>', 'Not blurry, in my opinion.', '2008-03-12 14:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558311, 655099, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cute little sucker!  Not an especially blurred shot other than the background.  Mostly it looks as though sharpening wasn''t applied.</td>', 'Cute little sucker!  Not an especially blurred shot other than the background.  Mostly it looks as though sharpening wasn''t applied.', '2008-03-12 14:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558312, 656469, 68256, '<td valign="top">Ouch this really hurts my eyes.  I have to give you an 8 even though I don''t like the abstractness because you have met the challenge perfectly, created interest, provided a path for my eyes and made me think.  Perfect for this challenge.</td>', 'Ouch this really hurts my eyes.  I have to give you an 8 even though I don''t like the abstractness because you have met the challenge perfectly, created interest, provided a path for my eyes and made me think.  Perfect for this challenge.', '2008-03-12 14:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558315, 656075, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cool - they don''t look quite real, especially with the odd angle of the heads.</td>', 'Cool - they don''t look quite real, especially with the odd angle of the heads.', '2008-03-12 14:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558316, 655908, 86447, '<td valign="top">Very cool photo... but not a blurry mess, in my opinion.</td>', 'Very cool photo... but not a blurry mess, in my opinion.', '2008-03-12 14:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558317, 656086, 86447, '<td valign="top">I think it all must be blurry to meet the challenge.  Sorry.</td>', 'I think it all must be blurry to meet the challenge.  Sorry.', '2008-03-12 14:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558319, 657073, 30982, '<td valign="top">The contrasting colors are lovely with the red sharply offset by the blue of the rocks, and just that bit of orange.  There is some nice motion blur from the wind, but overall it''s actually a pretty sharp shot.  Still, what blur there is kinda gives a sense of movement.</td>', 'The contrasting colors are lovely with the red sharply offset by the blue of the rocks, and just that bit of orange.  There is some nice motion blur from the wind, but overall it''s actually a pretty sharp shot.  Still, what blur there is kinda gives a sense of movement.', '2008-03-12 14:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558320, 656809, 86447, '<td valign="top">Looks sharply focused to me... not at all a blurry mess.  Sorry.</td>', 'Looks sharply focused to me... not at all a blurry mess.  Sorry.', '2008-03-12 14:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558323, 657077, 30982, '<td valign="top">This one takes a bit to see if you didn''t view the thumb first - and that''s a good thing.  Once you look at for a bit, it slowly comes into, well, not exactly focus, but substance.  An interesting take on the challenge!</td>', 'This one takes a bit to see if you didn''t view the thumb first - and that''s a good thing.  Once you look at for a bit, it slowly comes into, well, not exactly focus, but substance.  An interesting take on the challenge!', '2008-03-12 14:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558328, 656207, 86447, '<td valign="top">Looks focused to me... not a blurry mess as the challenge requires. Beautiful image, though.</td>', 'Looks focused to me... not a blurry mess as the challenge requires. Beautiful image, though.', '2008-03-12 14:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558329, 657105, 68256, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, motion and some concrete features to break up the path of the wondering eye..great job making me like a form of art I have no fondness of.</td>', 'Nice colors, motion and some concrete features to break up the path of the wondering eye..great job making me like a form of art I have no fondness of.', '2008-03-12 14:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558330, 654980, 30982, '<td valign="top">Yes, there''s blur, but I don''t see how it adds to the picture per se.  I''m not quite sure of what you were after - perhaps naked math wizards?  It''s definitely different, though!</td>', 'Yes, there''s blur, but I don''t see how it adds to the picture per se.  I''m not quite sure of what you were after - perhaps naked math wizards?  It''s definitely different, though!', '2008-03-12 14:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558335, 656833, 90777, '<td valign="top">A good concept however, you can see that your background has overpowered the shapes created by your moving subject.  Try lighting more from the front against a darker background.  I feel thirsty now;)</td>', 'A good concept however, you can see that your background has overpowered the shapes created by your moving subject.  Try lighting more from the front against a darker background.  I feel thirsty now;)', '2008-03-12 14:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558337, 656863, 63152, '<td valign="top">Sharp thinking..</td>', 'Sharp thinking..', '2008-03-12 14:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558338, 656230, 86447, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, well lit and shot.  But, in my opinion, the entire image should be a blurry mess to meet the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful image, well lit and shot.  But, in my opinion, the entire image should be a blurry mess to meet the challenge.', '2008-03-12 14:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558339, 657036, 30982, '<td valign="top">Feels warm, like a furnace.  Not sure about the title tie-in but perhaps I''m missing something.</td>', 'Feels warm, like a furnace.  Not sure about the title tie-in but perhaps I''m missing something.', '2008-03-12 14:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558343, 656371, 86447, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  But, it doesn''t seem ''blurry'' to me...</td>', 'Beautiful!  But, it doesn''t seem ''blurry'' to me...', '2008-03-12 14:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558344, 655908, 90777, '<td valign="top">This is bloody hilarious!! but I just don''t see the blur or chaos.  Sorry</td>', 'This is bloody hilarious!! but I just don''t see the blur or chaos.  Sorry', '2008-03-12 14:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558347, 656567, 30982, '<td valign="top">A fly in a flower?  The motion and color is pretty good but the overall effect is a bit sickly looking in a way - not sure that''s the best way to describe it, though.</td>', 'A fly in a flower?  The motion and color is pretty good but the overall effect is a bit sickly looking in a way - not sure that''s the best way to describe it, though.', '2008-03-12 14:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558348, 656674, 63152, '<td valign="top">I think it''s quite pretty</td>', 'I think it''s quite pretty', '2008-03-12 14:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558351, 657036, 63152, '<td valign="top">Interesting shapes in this one</td>', 'Interesting shapes in this one', '2008-03-12 14:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558352, 656396, 63152, '<td valign="top">The type of shot that''s usually very standard but I like the contrast between the sharper streaks of light with the softer blur in the top left corner,</td>', 'The type of shot that''s usually very standard but I like the contrast between the sharper streaks of light with the softer blur in the top left corner,', '2008-03-12 14:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558353, 657023, 86447, '<td valign="top">Looks like the subject is in focus to me...   Nice panning shot, but in my opinion, it didn''t meet the challenge.  I''m sorry.</td>', 'Looks like the subject is in focus to me...   Nice panning shot, but in my opinion, it didn''t meet the challenge.  I''m sorry.', '2008-03-12 14:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558354, 656856, 63152, '<td valign="top">Very simple. Maybe too simple. Still quite intriguing</td>', 'Very simple. Maybe too simple. Still quite intriguing', '2008-03-12 14:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558355, 655018, 63152, '<td valign="top">This one is all about colour and repetition. I don''t know yet if I like it or not but it''s quite intriguing.</td>', 'This one is all about colour and repetition. I don''t know yet if I like it or not but it''s quite intriguing.', '2008-03-12 14:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558356, 655018, 86447, '<td valign="top">LOVE the title!    Beautiful image to accompany it.</td>', 'LOVE the title!    Beautiful image to accompany it.', '2008-03-12 14:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558358, 655840, 63152, '<td valign="top">Forgot the glasses? (used to happen to me all the time)</td>', 'Forgot the glasses? (used to happen to me all the time)', '2008-03-12 14:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558359, 657101, 86447, '<td valign="top">LOL @ your title!</td>', 'LOL @ your title!', '2008-03-12 14:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558362, 657037, 86447, '<td valign="top">Absolutely FABULOUS colors!</td>', 'Absolutely FABULOUS colors!', '2008-03-12 14:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558363, 657092, 63152, '<td valign="top">Abstract (well duh) and very pretty. Doesn''t really look blurred (to me) though. I mean I know it''s blur but the lines are sharp and the colours are crisp it could be a sharp photo of a weird plastic object.</td>', 'Abstract (well duh) and very pretty. Doesn''t really look blurred (to me) though. I mean I know it''s blur but the lines are sharp and the colours are crisp it could be a sharp photo of a weird plastic object.', '2008-03-12 14:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558365, 656846, 86447, '<td valign="top">Too focused to be a blurry mess, in my opinion.</td>', 'Too focused to be a blurry mess, in my opinion.', '2008-03-12 14:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558367, 657089, 63152, '<td valign="top">For some reason I don''t quite like this one. It''s a bit too jagged or something. Well done though and it''s a *really* difficult challenge to deal with.</td>', 'For some reason I don''t quite like this one. It''s a bit too jagged or something. Well done though and it''s a *really* difficult challenge to deal with.', '2008-03-12 14:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558368, 655583, 86447, '<td valign="top">The dashboard seems too focused to be a blurry mess to me... but I really like this image.   Frame it!</td>', 'The dashboard seems too focused to be a blurry mess to me... but I really like this image.   Frame it!', '2008-03-12 14:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558369, 656832, 86447, '<td valign="top">I like the image... but not a blurry mess, in my opinion.</td>', 'I like the image... but not a blurry mess, in my opinion.', '2008-03-12 14:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558370, 656660, 90777, '<td valign="top">This is making me feel sick and dizzy....  I like it!</td>', 'This is making me feel sick and dizzy....  I like it!', '2008-03-12 14:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558371, 656993, 63152, '<td valign="top">This one looks just out of focus to me. Having a bit more variation in the blur (either through motion or a different DOF might make it more engaging to me but I''m not sure. The colours are pretty though.</td>', 'This one looks just out of focus to me. Having a bit more variation in the blur (either through motion or a different DOF might make it more engaging to me but I''m not sure. The colours are pretty though.', '2008-03-12 14:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558373, 656289, 86447, '<td valign="top">Looks to focused to me... to be a "blurry mess"</td>', 'Looks to focused to me... to be a "blurry mess"', '2008-03-12 14:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558384, 656490, 67258, '<td valign="top">Woah, this isn''t doing my Menieres any good!  The composition is good for the zoom burst and does give something of the sense of motion that you get when pigeons sre in a feeding frenzy.</td>', 'Woah, this isn''t doing my Menieres any good!  The composition is good for the zoom burst and does give something of the sense of motion that you get when pigeons sre in a feeding frenzy.', '2008-03-12 14:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558388, 656483, 67258, '<td valign="top">I find this a little too chaotic to be aesthetically pleasing.  The areas of white are very bright, almost retina burning!</td>', 'I find this a little too chaotic to be aesthetically pleasing.  The areas of white are very bright, almost retina burning!', '2008-03-12 14:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558389, 657083, 86447, '<td valign="top">It''s a wonderful, exciting image... but it appears to be in focus... and not ''blurry'' as the Challenge called for.  Sorry.   I really like it.  *sigh*<br/> <br/>[edit]"the blurriest, most chaotic and disorganized image" is what the challenge instructed.  Yours seems very organized... and the light ''sparks'' are so in focus that it doesn''t seem to be ''the blurriest'' image.  You nailed the ''chaotic'', though.  Perhaps if your focus was just a bit more ''off'' (I can''t believe I''m saying this! *Grin* ) then this would have met the topic better.</td>', 'It''s a wonderful, exciting image... but it appears to be in focus... and not ''blurry'' as the Challenge called for.  Sorry.   I really like it.  *sigh* [edit]"the blurriest, most chaotic and disorganized image" is what the challenge instructed.  Yours seems very organized... and the light ''sparks'' are so in focus that it doesn''t seem to be ''the blurriest'' image.  You nailed the ''chaotic'', though.  Perhaps if your focus was just a bit more ''off'' (I can''t believe I''m saying this! *Grin* ) then this would have met the topic better.', '2008-03-12 14:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558390, 656164, 86447, '<td valign="top">Great image and clever title... but not blurry enough for a blurry challenge.</td>', 'Great image and clever title... but not blurry enough for a blurry challenge.', '2008-03-12 14:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
