(4558635, 655757, 36999, '<td valign="top">nice emotion in this one</td>', 'nice emotion in this one', '2008-03-12 16:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558636, 656753, 22301, '<td valign="top">I think this photo is very good for this challenge. It is based solely on its mood and I think the fact that you picked a scene that can in itself be very chaotic made it very good choice for this challenge.</td>', 'I think this photo is very good for this challenge. It is based solely on its mood and I think the fact that you picked a scene that can in itself be very chaotic made it very good choice for this challenge.', '2008-03-12 16:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558637, 655470, 30982, '<td valign="top">Colorful and chaotic.  I find myself trying to figure the dots in the distance.</td>', 'Colorful and chaotic.  I find myself trying to figure the dots in the distance.', '2008-03-12 16:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558638, 655628, 30982, '<td valign="top">An excellent abstract.</td>', 'An excellent abstract.', '2008-03-12 16:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558641, 656900, 36999, '<td valign="top">this is nice.  good composition, color and emotion</td>', 'this is nice.  good composition, color and emotion', '2008-03-12 16:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558644, 655991, 42171, '<td valign="top">Slightly better than a 5 as this is one of the only "Blurry" photos that has held my interest for more than 5 seconds so far!<br/>6 for the "5".</td>', 'Slightly better than a 5 as this is one of the only "Blurry" photos that has held my interest for more than 5 seconds so far!6 for the "5".', '2008-03-12 16:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558646, 656846, 89341, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t quite meet the challenge IMHO, a little blurry, not really chaotic or disorganised but I don''t find the image particularly interesting, sorry. Maybe if there had been another vehicle in the mirror ... maybe if the car you were in was going round a roundabout or something (assuming you weren''t driving of course!!)</td>', 'Doesn''t quite meet the challenge IMHO, a little blurry, not really chaotic or disorganised but I don''t find the image particularly interesting, sorry. Maybe if there had been another vehicle in the mirror ... maybe if the car you were in was going round a roundabout or something (assuming you weren''t driving of course!!)', '2008-03-12 16:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558647, 657102, 42171, '<td valign="top">Nice.<br/>Is blurry yet reconiseable, plus interesting. Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice.Is blurry yet reconiseable, plus interesting. Nice composition.', '2008-03-12 16:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558652, 656798, 22301, '<td valign="top">just like a painting! the strong color behind the white birds make for a nice separation from the foreground and background blur. I don''t know why but the background reminds of garbage and the photo takes me back to those fun days as a kid when my dad would take me to the dumps and as I had the pleasure of throwing away old junk out of the back of the truck the sea gulls would fly by looking for meals.</td>', 'just like a painting! the strong color behind the white birds make for a nice separation from the foreground and background blur. I don''t know why but the background reminds of garbage and the photo takes me back to those fun days as a kid when my dad would take me to the dumps and as I had the pleasure of throwing away old junk out of the back of the truck the sea gulls would fly by looking for meals.', '2008-03-12 16:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558655, 655908, 30982, '<td valign="top">An enjoyable candid and I really like the guys who are crowding around to check out how they look in the picture.  Probably not a good entry for this particular challenge, though, as it''s not very blurry (indeed, it''s nice and sharp) nor chaotic.</td>', 'An enjoyable candid and I really like the guys who are crowding around to check out how they look in the picture.  Probably not a good entry for this particular challenge, though, as it''s not very blurry (indeed, it''s nice and sharp) nor chaotic.', '2008-03-12 16:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558656, 655837, 89341, '<td valign="top">the image is nice, background is blurred and chaotic so meets challenge IMHO (though I''m sure you''ve got loads saying it doesn''t), I am more focused on the twig rather than the feather, not sure if that''s what you intended ... does lack a little colour IMHO though</td>', 'the image is nice, background is blurred and chaotic so meets challenge IMHO (though I''m sure you''ve got loads saying it doesn''t), I am more focused on the twig rather than the feather, not sure if that''s what you intended ... does lack a little colour IMHO though', '2008-03-12 16:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558658, 656407, 22301, '<td valign="top">I like the inclusion of the light in the top right and far left. Balanced with highlights of the singer and guitar player gives the image a nice triangle of light to keep me moving around the image, engaging me.</td>', 'I like the inclusion of the light in the top right and far left. Balanced with highlights of the singer and guitar player gives the image a nice triangle of light to keep me moving around the image, engaging me.', '2008-03-12 16:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558660, 656075, 89341, '<td valign="top">I like the colours, certainly meets challenge, the bar at the top left is a little distracting though</td>', 'I like the colours, certainly meets challenge, the bar at the top left is a little distracting though', '2008-03-12 16:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558661, 657123, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very clever how the lines go through to her heart!  I suspect this may not be blurry enough (and isn''t really blurry at all) for the challenge but it does have an interesting sense of chaos to it.</td>', 'Very clever how the lines go through to her heart!  I suspect this may not be blurry enough (and isn''t really blurry at all) for the challenge but it does have an interesting sense of chaos to it.', '2008-03-12 16:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558662, 656011, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m getting the impression of soft (marshmallows!) but not blurry or chaos.</td>', 'I''m getting the impression of soft (marshmallows!) but not blurry or chaos.', '2008-03-12 16:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558665, 656544, 30982, '<td valign="top">You may not be scoring well if people are considering the water as the subject vice the trees which are blurred in the reflection.</td>', 'You may not be scoring well if people are considering the water as the subject vice the trees which are blurred in the reflection.', '2008-03-12 16:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558669, 656174, 30982, '<td valign="top">An excellent use of bokeh to add to the impact of your photograph.</td>', 'An excellent use of bokeh to add to the impact of your photograph.', '2008-03-12 16:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558672, 656676, 89341, '<td valign="top">blurry yes, not so much chaotic and disorganised, maybe an even slower shutter speed would have made it more so .... does just about meet the challenge. Certainly an interesting and engaging photograph though and I think the desat works well</td>', 'blurry yes, not so much chaotic and disorganised, maybe an even slower shutter speed would have made it more so .... does just about meet the challenge. Certainly an interesting and engaging photograph though and I think the desat works well', '2008-03-12 16:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558673, 656284, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is a good response to the challenge.  My only nit would be the dullish shade of green as the badkground - a bit brigher would offset the pink better perhaps.</td>', 'This is a good response to the challenge.  My only nit would be the dullish shade of green as the badkground - a bit brigher would offset the pink better perhaps.', '2008-03-12 16:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558675, 656670, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice sense of motion - almost looks like they''re playing leapfrog.  Or leappelican as the case may be.</td>', 'Nice sense of motion - almost looks like they''re playing leapfrog.  Or leappelican as the case may be.', '2008-03-12 16:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558676, 656947, 89341, '<td valign="top">I''m certainly scared!! Certainly meets challenge .... messes with my head if I look at it too long!</td>', 'I''m certainly scared!! Certainly meets challenge .... messes with my head if I look at it too long!', '2008-03-12 16:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558679, 656845, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of color and flow to create a pleasing abstract.</td>', 'Very nice use of color and flow to create a pleasing abstract.', '2008-03-12 16:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558682, 657083, 30982, '<td valign="top">VERY chaotic!  Nice energy and flow.  Not especially blurry, though.</td>', 'VERY chaotic!  Nice energy and flow.  Not especially blurry, though.', '2008-03-12 16:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558683, 656266, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice light painting - well seen.</td>', 'Very nice light painting - well seen.', '2008-03-12 16:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558686, 656498, 30982, '<td valign="top">Definitely has an energy and movement to it!</td>', 'Definitely has an energy and movement to it!', '2008-03-12 16:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558687, 656834, 89341, '<td valign="top">Certainly blurry, chaotic and disorganised ... the colours all blend into one a little though ... I have no idea what the person has in their hands so that takes a little away, but not much</td>', 'Certainly blurry, chaotic and disorganised ... the colours all blend into one a little though ... I have no idea what the person has in their hands so that takes a little away, but not much', '2008-03-12 16:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558688, 657064, 89341, '<td valign="top">Nice bright photo, works well</td>', 'Nice bright photo, works well', '2008-03-12 16:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558691, 657140, 35947, '<td valign="top">This is really cool and well done!  Got the blur, feels chaotic, and it''s interesting!</td>', 'This is really cool and well done!  Got the blur, feels chaotic, and it''s interesting!', '2008-03-12 16:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558692, 657101, 89341, '<td valign="top">Colours work well and I like the title ... I''ll pass on seeing the rest though  if that''s ok :)</td>', 'Colours work well and I like the title ... I''ll pass on seeing the rest though  if that''s ok :)', '2008-03-12 16:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558693, 656207, 89341, '<td valign="top">Colours are great, the lights work really well ... very nice to look at</td>', 'Colours are great, the lights work really well ... very nice to look at', '2008-03-12 16:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558694, 655908, 35947, '<td valign="top">Where''s the blur?</td>', 'Where''s the blur?', '2008-03-12 16:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558695, 656217, 89341, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, had to look twice to see but got it.</td>', 'Nice capture, had to look twice to see but got it.', '2008-03-12 16:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558696, 656833, 35947, '<td valign="top">I wish you could see the cartwheel better.  The pop machines over power everything else and they are not too interesting IMHO.</td>', 'I wish you could see the cartwheel better.  The pop machines over power everything else and they are not too interesting IMHO.', '2008-03-12 16:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558698, 656914, 89341, '<td valign="top">The yellow works very well, simple yet effective</td>', 'The yellow works very well, simple yet effective', '2008-03-12 16:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558699, 656082, 89341, '<td valign="top">Nice, the bike gets my full attention ... good colours as well</td>', 'Nice, the bike gets my full attention ... good colours as well', '2008-03-12 16:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558700, 657021, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh, I like this one!  That bit of bright with that bit of rust all spun into the blue... nice.</td>', 'Oh, I like this one!  That bit of bright with that bit of rust all spun into the blue... nice.', '2008-03-12 16:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558702, 655446, 35947, '<td valign="top">Got lots of blur but the lack of colors doesn''t hold my interest long as a vote.  (Sorry I like pretty shiny stuff!)  :)</td>', 'Got lots of blur but the lack of colors doesn''t hold my interest long as a vote.  (Sorry I like pretty shiny stuff!)  :)', '2008-03-12 16:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558704, 656584, 30982, '<td valign="top">A nice dance of purples tinged with a touch of green.</td>', 'A nice dance of purples tinged with a touch of green.', '2008-03-12 16:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558705, 654996, 30982, '<td valign="top">Another excellent abstract of light and color - nicely seen.</td>', 'Another excellent abstract of light and color - nicely seen.', '2008-03-12 16:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558707, 656809, 35947, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle, the blur in the machine is hard to see though with this lighting.</td>', 'Interesting angle, the blur in the machine is hard to see though with this lighting.', '2008-03-12 16:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558709, 655583, 89341, '<td valign="top">I like the idea ... it''s a little too grey IMHO ... I like the fact the car is in the center of the road, maybe adjusting the mirror would have added to that centralisation a little more</td>', 'I like the idea ... it''s a little too grey IMHO ... I like the fact the car is in the center of the road, maybe adjusting the mirror would have added to that centralisation a little more', '2008-03-12 16:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558710, 656354, 30982, '<td valign="top">Somehow this works for me.  The blur adds the touch of life to an otherwise static scene.</td>', 'Somehow this works for me.  The blur adds the touch of life to an otherwise static scene.', '2008-03-12 16:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558714, 656469, 30982, '<td valign="top">Richly bright and chaotic.</td>', 'Richly bright and chaotic.', '2008-03-12 16:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558716, 656148, 89341, '<td valign="top">Colours are good, interesting photo, blurry wings are good ... not really chaotic or disorganised but only a point knocked off for that</td>', 'Colours are good, interesting photo, blurry wings are good ... not really chaotic or disorganised but only a point knocked off for that', '2008-03-12 16:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558720, 656998, 89341, '<td valign="top">Nice use of DOF ... the background colours add to the chaotic and disorganised theme and I like the title :)</td>', 'Nice use of DOF ... the background colours add to the chaotic and disorganised theme and I like the title :)', '2008-03-12 16:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558721, 657047, 89341, '<td valign="top">Very nice painting feel to the image, colours are great</td>', 'Very nice painting feel to the image, colours are great', '2008-03-12 16:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558725, 656578, 89341, '<td valign="top">The blur gives a painting feel to the image, works well, I like it</td>', 'The blur gives a painting feel to the image, works well, I like it', '2008-03-12 16:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558732, 656802, 89341, '<td valign="top">The black and white in the image is striking, the ghostly figures are kind of too faint IMHO and I find the clock is the centre of my attention so I don''t notice the blurred figures till much later. Maybe a higher angle and a closer shot of a disorganised desk would work a little better. It''s a little too far away from blurriest, most chaotic and disorganized but is certainly engaging and interesting so half way there!</td>', 'The black and white in the image is striking, the ghostly figures are kind of too faint IMHO and I find the clock is the centre of my attention so I don''t notice the blurred figures till much later. Maybe a higher angle and a closer shot of a disorganised desk would work a little better. It''s a little too far away from blurriest, most chaotic and disorganized but is certainly engaging and interesting so half way there!', '2008-03-12 16:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558733, 657095, 74588, '<td valign="top">blue ribbon stuff   10</td>', 'blue ribbon stuff   10', '2008-03-12 16:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558736, 655917, 89341, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if the horse was moving but I don''t quite get a sense of motion if thats what you were going for. The colours are good and the subject is good ...  certainly meets the challenge</td>', 'I''m not sure if the horse was moving but I don''t quite get a sense of motion if thats what you were going for. The colours are good and the subject is good ...  certainly meets the challenge', '2008-03-12 16:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558737, 655448, 63218, '<td valign="top">I''m not liking the large area of blowout very much, it would be better as accent, now it looks like subject.  :(   I do like the light trails, though, I''m thinking of a carnival.</td>', 'I''m not liking the large area of blowout very much, it would be better as accent, now it looks like subject.  :(   I do like the light trails, though, I''m thinking of a carnival.', '2008-03-12 16:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558739, 656244, 89341, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, the movement gives me a sense of how much effort the guy is putting into holding himself there ... not really chaotic and disorganized, quite the opposite I think ... It''s certainly an engaging and interesting photo though</td>', 'Nice capture, the movement gives me a sense of how much effort the guy is putting into holding himself there ... not really chaotic and disorganized, quite the opposite I think ... It''s certainly an engaging and interesting photo though', '2008-03-12 16:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558740, 655144, 22301, '<td valign="top">The colors are nice, but doesn''t seem too blurry. I like how the colors and designs move my eye around the photo.</td>', 'The colors are nice, but doesn''t seem too blurry. I like how the colors and designs move my eye around the photo.', '2008-03-12 16:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558742, 656002, 22301, '<td valign="top">A nice study in flight. good luck</td>', 'A nice study in flight. good luck', '2008-03-12 16:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558751, 656670, 89341, '<td valign="top">Good movement blur on the birds ... the image seems a little flat to me though, maybe some hue / sat adjustments would help ... not too chaotic or disorganised but a nice image none the less</td>', 'Good movement blur on the birds ... the image seems a little flat to me though, maybe some hue / sat adjustments would help ... not too chaotic or disorganised but a nice image none the less', '2008-03-12 16:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558756, 656564, 89341, '<td valign="top">certainly blurriest, chaotic and disorganized ... though I''m not quite sure what I am looking at so that looses a little of my interest ... train tracks?</td>', 'certainly blurriest, chaotic and disorganized ... though I''m not quite sure what I am looking at so that looses a little of my interest ... train tracks?', '2008-03-12 16:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558759, 655855, 89341, '<td valign="top">It is a little blurry and a little disorganized and a little engaging and interesting but doesn''t, IMHO, excel in any of them, sorry</td>', 'It is a little blurry and a little disorganized and a little engaging and interesting but doesn''t, IMHO, excel in any of them, sorry', '2008-03-12 16:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558761, 657002, 91076, '<td valign="top">just spooky!</td>', 'just spooky!', '2008-03-12 16:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558763, 655712, 89341, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, the ball flying up looks great .. the cars in the background are a little distracting but not much</td>', 'Nice capture, the ball flying up looks great .. the cars in the background are a little distracting but not much', '2008-03-12 16:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558765, 656818, 89341, '<td valign="top">Great colours</td>', 'Great colours', '2008-03-12 16:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558770, 656811, 89219, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge, nice to see a different approach.  8</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge, nice to see a different approach.  8', '2008-03-12 16:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558772, 656548, 91076, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  Not sure its a blurry mess, though.  What is it?</td>', 'Great photo.  Not sure its a blurry mess, though.  What is it?', '2008-03-12 16:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558774, 656563, 89219, '<td valign="top">The out of focus glasses is a good idea but I cant help thinking you could have done better with it.  Placing them on a tripod just doesn''t work for me .</td>', 'The out of focus glasses is a good idea but I cant help thinking you could have done better with it.  Placing them on a tripod just doesn''t work for me .', '2008-03-12 16:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558781, 656625, 89219, '<td valign="top">There''s way to much noise and if it wern''t for the title I may not have noticed the TV.</td>', 'There''s way to much noise and if it wern''t for the title I may not have noticed the TV.', '2008-03-12 16:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558784, 657141, 30982, '<td valign="top">Haunting and quite lovely.</td>', 'Haunting and quite lovely.', '2008-03-12 16:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558785, 656783, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very striking composition with good color.</td>', 'A very striking composition with good color.', '2008-03-12 16:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4558786, 657085, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!!  An abstract with whiskers!</td>', 'Wonderful!!  An abstract with whiskers!', '2008-03-12 16:53:15.000000', NULL, 1);
