(4558820, 656087, 89341, '<td valign="top">It''s a little too "all blended into one" to hold my interest for too long, sorry ... maybe if there were a couple of vague shapes maybe</td>', 'It''s a little too "all blended into one" to hold my interest for too long, sorry ... maybe if there were a couple of vague shapes maybe', '2008-03-12 17:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
