(4559251, 656155, 65234, '<td valign="top">I''m struggling a bit with this one.  The background is pleasantly blurry but the subject is definitely not blurry, or chaotic, or disorganized, or even messy.  It''s like the foreground and background belong to two different images (which fact makes the image discordant ... I guess that could be interpreted as a form of chaos).  This just isn''t as thoroughly chaotic as some others I''ve seen.</td>', 'I''m struggling a bit with this one.  The background is pleasantly blurry but the subject is definitely not blurry, or chaotic, or disorganized, or even messy.  It''s like the foreground and background belong to two different images (which fact makes the image discordant ... I guess that could be interpreted as a form of chaos).  This just isn''t as thoroughly chaotic as some others I''ve seen.', '2008-03-12 19:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4559252, 656429, 59029, '<td valign="top">I understand it''s a staged shot but if the smaller child had been the one kicking the bigger, it would be more effective.  This just looks like bullying.</td>', 'I understand it''s a staged shot but if the smaller child had been the one kicking the bigger, it would be more effective.  This just looks like bullying.', '2008-03-12 19:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
