(4560230, 657140, 83313, '<td valign="top"><strike>It''s a great image, though I would not call it neither blurry, nor messy. It''s a cool distortion though. </strike> <br/> <br/>Ok, this one had me fooled until I realized you were in a chair, spinning it around and that was the blur. Still no mess, however. Unless the mess part is what happened to your lunch after doing this.<br/> <br/>A good score from me for creativity and fooling me for not looking carefully enough.</td>', 'It''s a great image, though I would not call it neither blurry, nor messy. It''s a cool distortion though.   Ok, this one had me fooled until I realized you were in a chair, spinning it around and that was the blur. Still no mess, however. Unless the mess part is what happened to your lunch after doing this. A good score from me for creativity and fooling me for not looking carefully enough.', '2008-03-12 23:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
