(4560559, 655811, 90394, '<td valign="top">These "spun camera" shots are hard to grade against one another, but I won''t ding you for that, since you couldn''t know. Not the most creative way to achieve "blurry mess", but it works. I like looking at this, wouldn''t call it "engaging", but mildly interesting - if only for the wild colors! Good entry.</td>', 'These "spun camera" shots are hard to grade against one another, but I won''t ding you for that, since you couldn''t know. Not the most creative way to achieve "blurry mess", but it works. I like looking at this, wouldn''t call it "engaging", but mildly interesting - if only for the wild colors! Good entry.', '2008-03-13 02:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560575, 656358, 90394, '<td valign="top">This is yet another where I must appease the "mess" gods, which is a very subjective term. I''m approaching this as though you concieved it as "messy" as a whole, in which case this fits the theme - but I would like to have seen more elements of disorganization in here, or something "out of control"  with unintended consequences. Overall, a prismatic photo with a nice look, but ultimately an average quasi-abstract. Perhaps a different subject would have helped?</td>', 'This is yet another where I must appease the "mess" gods, which is a very subjective term. I''m approaching this as though you concieved it as "messy" as a whole, in which case this fits the theme - but I would like to have seen more elements of disorganization in here, or something "out of control"  with unintended consequences. Overall, a prismatic photo with a nice look, but ultimately an average quasi-abstract. Perhaps a different subject would have helped?', '2008-03-13 02:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560591, 656659, 90394, '<td valign="top">I would classify this as another common abstract, that almost seems too easy for this challenging theme. Blurry, indeed. But it''s hard to call this messy, or chaotic, when it has little "out of control" elements that would suggest it wasn''t a completely planned consequence of of a planned camera action. That''s what makes this challenge so difficult to navigate. This is a situation where a different subject may have helped - something nebulous, fragmented, or amorphous that you couldn''t account for how the light may have played out - but would have an interesting, engaging result. This describes what I was looking for, elementally speaking, in this challenge. I did find a precious few that fit this description.<br/> <br/>Are these flowers? That''s what it looks like to me - though I won''t use my guess in the scoring here. Either way, this seem like an average abstract. <br/> <br/>Not poor by any means, but nothing outstanding either.</td>', 'I would classify this as another common abstract, that almost seems too easy for this challenging theme. Blurry, indeed. But it''s hard to call this messy, or chaotic, when it has little "out of control" elements that would suggest it wasn''t a completely planned consequence of of a planned camera action. That''s what makes this challenge so difficult to navigate. This is a situation where a different subject may have helped - something nebulous, fragmented, or amorphous that you couldn''t account for how the light may have played out - but would have an interesting, engaging result. This describes what I was looking for, elementally speaking, in this challenge. I did find a precious few that fit this description. Are these flowers? That''s what it looks like to me - though I won''t use my guess in the scoring here. Either way, this seem like an average abstract.  Not poor by any means, but nothing outstanding either.', '2008-03-13 03:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560610, 656005, 90394, '<td valign="top">This seems like another average, blurry photo to me, and not wholeheartedly in the spirit of the theme. I''m not gonna ding you for it, but I''m not going to award any messy, chaotic, or disorganized points either. Although this is an otherwise fine capture, it fails to engage, or delight when it''s such an obvious design.<br/> <br/>I''m looking for fundamentally unintended consequences of light and color when scoring these.</td>', 'This seems like another average, blurry photo to me, and not wholeheartedly in the spirit of the theme. I''m not gonna ding you for it, but I''m not going to award any messy, chaotic, or disorganized points either. Although this is an otherwise fine capture, it fails to engage, or delight when it''s such an obvious design. I''m looking for fundamentally unintended consequences of light and color when scoring these.', '2008-03-13 03:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560619, 655837, 90394, '<td valign="top">Otherwise fine photography - but lacking that chaotic, unintended consequence that would make something here appear messy, and less compositional, a touch of disorder - something unordinary that catches color or light in unique, interesting ways. I''m not gonna ding for having an <i>in focus</i> element, but my criteria is that at least the subject should be blurred. Only the background is, here.<br/> <br/>I have found a few creative entries, but I can''t qualify this as a creative use of this particularly challenging theme.</td>', 'Otherwise fine photography - but lacking that chaotic, unintended consequence that would make something here appear messy, and less compositional, a touch of disorder - something unordinary that catches color or light in unique, interesting ways. I''m not gonna ding for having an in focus element, but my criteria is that at least the subject should be blurred. Only the background is, here. I have found a few creative entries, but I can''t qualify this as a creative use of this particularly challenging theme.', '2008-03-13 03:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4560629, 657086, 90394, '<td valign="top">Another common camera-action abstract. I was looking for more creativity with the challenging theme, and am not particularly engaged by what is otherwise a fine capture.</td>', 'Another common camera-action abstract. I was looking for more creativity with the challenging theme, and am not particularly engaged by what is otherwise a fine capture.', '2008-03-13 03:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
