(4561552, 657141, 90394, '<td valign="top">There''s a few of these on the challenge, and I think this is the best of the "camera spin" effect. Very engaging for me, and fits the criteria, albeit in a simplistic fashion. Some won''t see mess, but what do they want, some garbage (literal) floating around? I''d rather look at this.<br/> <br/>My exploration of this image says to me that <i>this is a tree</i>, and the simple chaos in the natural subject is applicable to the wording of this challenge - if not it''s implied idea.<br/> <br/>I''m not awarding any points for being overtly creative, but I''m not scoring this as a simple abstract either. The subject  was key for me here.</td>', 'There''s a few of these on the challenge, and I think this is the best of the "camera spin" effect. Very engaging for me, and fits the criteria, albeit in a simplistic fashion. Some won''t see mess, but what do they want, some garbage (literal) floating around? I''d rather look at this. My exploration of this image says to me that this is a tree, and the simple chaos in the natural subject is applicable to the wording of this challenge - if not it''s implied idea. I''m not awarding any points for being overtly creative, but I''m not scoring this as a simple abstract either. The subject  was key for me here.', '2008-03-13 12:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4561559, 656546, 73235, '<td valign="top">well done. great job creating the zoom trails. you picked an excellent location for this typw of technique.</td>', 'well done. great job creating the zoom trails. you picked an excellent location for this typw of technique.', '2008-03-13 12:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4561560, 656469, 90394, '<td valign="top">A fine entry, and very creative. Nice abstract, and this would look good on a wall, to boot. Well done!<br/> <br/>But having said that - it''s hard to imply that there''s somehow anything "messy" in this image, since the consequences seem completely intended, rather than the inverse. <br/> <br/>I was looking for a bit more originality, and an element of the "unplanned", which is what makes this challenge so hard to score.</td>', 'A fine entry, and very creative. Nice abstract, and this would look good on a wall, to boot. Well done! But having said that - it''s hard to imply that there''s somehow anything "messy" in this image, since the consequences seem completely intended, rather than the inverse.  I was looking for a bit more originality, and an element of the "unplanned", which is what makes this challenge so hard to score.', '2008-03-13 12:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4561562, 657132, 73235, '<td valign="top">I like this picture on 2 levels: the forms and curves altough in nature very dynamic. combined with the warm brown color and the brighter area in the top middle creates a point to rest and explore along the curves</td>', 'I like this picture on 2 levels: the forms and curves altough in nature very dynamic. combined with the warm brown color and the brighter area in the top middle creates a point to rest and explore along the curves', '2008-03-13 12:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4561567, 657136, 90394, '<td valign="top">I''m really happy to see such creativity in such a tough challenge - and will mention the elements that stand out here. Creative use of blurriness, slightly messy (probably not enough for most voters), and would have benefitted from the glass being completely shattered somehow. I''ll add this two cents: the subject isn''t much in the way of engaging, but it was interesting enough for me to take a few minutes here. I appreciate an inventive entry - many were simply a "mess". Good job!</td>', 'I''m really happy to see such creativity in such a tough challenge - and will mention the elements that stand out here. Creative use of blurriness, slightly messy (probably not enough for most voters), and would have benefitted from the glass being completely shattered somehow. I''ll add this two cents: the subject isn''t much in the way of engaging, but it was interesting enough for me to take a few minutes here. I appreciate an inventive entry - many were simply a "mess". Good job!', '2008-03-13 12:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4561568, 657036, 90394, '<td valign="top">This one seems to fit the bill very well, in regard to it''s abstract, chaotic and messy composition. I would dare say it is a hair <i>too</i> messy, and could have used just a tiny bit more tuning. The gremlin of this challenge: <i>...messiest, blurriest, disorganized that you can, and still have it <b>interesting and engaging.</b></i> I feel like you achieved this to some degree, and have posited an above average submission in this sense. Overall, a fine entry, and I scored accordingly. Many entries are simply messy, and blurry, and don''t interest me. This one does, just not overtly. <br/> <br/>Good job!</td>', 'This one seems to fit the bill very well, in regard to it''s abstract, chaotic and messy composition. I would dare say it is a hair too messy, and could have used just a tiny bit more tuning. The gremlin of this challenge: ...messiest, blurriest, disorganized that you can, and still have it interesting and engaging. I feel like you achieved this to some degree, and have posited an above average submission in this sense. Overall, a fine entry, and I scored accordingly. Many entries are simply messy, and blurry, and don''t interest me. This one does, just not overtly.  Good job!', '2008-03-13 12:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
