(4561604, 655431, 90394, '<td valign="top">I really like this entry into the challenge, even though I don''t find this particularly engaging. You succeeded where many did not, though, in presenting the core implications of such a subjective challenge criteria. <br/> <br/>You have blur, creatively (if not compellingly so) through your window, which is appropriately messy, and with chaotic, apparently unintended consequences - congrats on that! Since many entries seem to miss this element.<br/> <br/>Disorganization is self evident here, and the play of light and distortion certainly qualify as to the nature of such a difficult challenge.<br/> <br/>If only the subject matter had been more interesting, this is basically what I was looking for! But not to worry, as this is at least a more viable entry than the many simple abstracts, which to me, belong in a different challenge.</td>', 'I really like this entry into the challenge, even though I don''t find this particularly engaging. You succeeded where many did not, though, in presenting the core implications of such a subjective challenge criteria.  You have blur, creatively (if not compellingly so) through your window, which is appropriately messy, and with chaotic, apparently unintended consequences - congrats on that! Since many entries seem to miss this element. Disorganization is self evident here, and the play of light and distortion certainly qualify as to the nature of such a difficult challenge. If only the subject matter had been more interesting, this is basically what I was looking for! But not to worry, as this is at least a more viable entry than the many simple abstracts, which to me, belong in a different challenge.', '2008-03-13 12:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
