(4561613, 656054, 90394, '<td valign="top">I''m really dismayed to see so many simple abstracts in such a wide open challenge. You have a fine image here, and the muted colors look good, but when the consequences of your camera action, and play of light and color seem so intentional, it makes it hard to qualify a disorganized, messy element here. <br/> <br/>I was really looking for more creativity, and more interesting, engaging subject matter, and not simply <i>abstracts.</i></td>', 'I''m really dismayed to see so many simple abstracts in such a wide open challenge. You have a fine image here, and the muted colors look good, but when the consequences of your camera action, and play of light and color seem so intentional, it makes it hard to qualify a disorganized, messy element here.  I was really looking for more creativity, and more interesting, engaging subject matter, and not simply abstracts.', '2008-03-13 13:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4561614, 655448, 70888, '<td valign="top">good to see you understood the challenge,seems most struggled with this challenge,except for the big blown out swath of white this rocks! mabe crop it out some...6 for "gettin it"</td>', 'good to see you understood the challenge,seems most struggled with this challenge,except for the big blown out swath of white this rocks! mabe crop it out some...6 for "gettin it"', '2008-03-13 13:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4561615, 656567, 90394, '<td valign="top">A patent abstract, in a wide open challenge that would have allowed for more creative license. There''s alot of these here, and they aren''t as engaging or interesting as those that explored the challenge criteria deeper.</td>', 'A patent abstract, in a wide open challenge that would have allowed for more creative license. There''s alot of these here, and they aren''t as engaging or interesting as those that explored the challenge criteria deeper.', '2008-03-13 13:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4561618, 656584, 90394, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the abstract to achieve blur, chaos and an interesting photo! Maybe could have used more "mess" - but that''s a subjective term, and shouldn''t cost this badly. Perhaps a more engaging subject would help too, but I''d call this above average, and nice to look at! I studied this for a few minutes and found what looks to be a lady in a night dress hidden in there... that pulls this ever so fractionally above average, since it compells me to look for more imagery within the photo.</td>', 'Nice use of the abstract to achieve blur, chaos and an interesting photo! Maybe could have used more "mess" - but that''s a subjective term, and shouldn''t cost this badly. Perhaps a more engaging subject would help too, but I''d call this above average, and nice to look at! I studied this for a few minutes and found what looks to be a lady in a night dress hidden in there... that pulls this ever so fractionally above average, since it compells me to look for more imagery within the photo.', '2008-03-13 13:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4561619, 656094, 70888, '<td valign="top">so far the most simple-looking <i>but effective</i> rendition of the challenge,6</td>', 'so far the most simple-looking but effective rendition of the challenge,6', '2008-03-13 13:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4561621, 656857, 70888, '<td valign="top">too clean for this challenge im afraid 5</td>', 'too clean for this challenge im afraid 5', '2008-03-13 13:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4561622, 656244, 70888, '<td valign="top">while there is blur,and this is a great image,i think its too clean for a blurry mess challenge</td>', 'while there is blur,and this is a great image,i think its too clean for a blurry mess challenge', '2008-03-13 13:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4561627, 656434, 70888, '<td valign="top">kool looking, nice take on a challenge most seem to be struggling with 6.</td>', 'kool looking, nice take on a challenge most seem to be struggling with 6.', '2008-03-13 13:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4561628, 656548, 90394, '<td valign="top">This is one of a precious few abstracts that I might rate above average, simply because it seems to have just enough of an "unintended" and chaotic liquid prism in it. So congrats, because this makes it <i>by the skin of it''s teeth</i> from mediocrity. <br/> <br/>I only say so because many entries are lacking in a truly unintended consequence of light and color, due to their over-planned nature. I''m not awarding too much in the way of creative points, though. A precious few entries dug a bit deeper to find more engaging, and interesting means of conveying "blurry mess".</td>', 'This is one of a precious few abstracts that I might rate above average, simply because it seems to have just enough of an "unintended" and chaotic liquid prism in it. So congrats, because this makes it by the skin of it''s teeth from mediocrity.  I only say so because many entries are lacking in a truly unintended consequence of light and color, due to their over-planned nature. I''m not awarding too much in the way of creative points, though. A precious few entries dug a bit deeper to find more engaging, and interesting means of conveying "blurry mess".', '2008-03-13 13:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4561634, 657002, 70888, '<td valign="top">emotional chaos,awesome...7</td>', 'emotional chaos,awesome...7', '2008-03-13 13:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4561636, 656686, 70888, '<td valign="top">i think i would have liked it without the crack better</td>', 'i think i would have liked it without the crack better', '2008-03-13 13:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4561640, 656985, 90394, '<td valign="top">Great abstract, and mostly fits the blurry mess motif.. Fun to look at, interesting and nice use of color!<br/> <br/>My only issue here is that it <i>is</i> another abstract, in a challenge that allowed more room to allow for creative flexibility due to its subjective implications.<br/> <br/>This is above average, however, since it goes (ever so slightly) beyond a simple motion blur of light, and the tendrils are an interesting subject, if not overtly engaging. Nice photo!</td>', 'Great abstract, and mostly fits the blurry mess motif.. Fun to look at, interesting and nice use of color! My only issue here is that it is another abstract, in a challenge that allowed more room to allow for creative flexibility due to its subjective implications. This is above average, however, since it goes (ever so slightly) beyond a simple motion blur of light, and the tendrils are an interesting subject, if not overtly engaging. Nice photo!', '2008-03-13 13:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4561643, 657045, 70888, '<td valign="top">while this is interesting,seems too in-focus for a blurry mess challenge (ice on a car?or bowling ball?)</td>', 'while this is interesting,seems too in-focus for a blurry mess challenge (ice on a car?or bowling ball?)', '2008-03-13 13:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4561648, 655841, 90394, '<td valign="top">Let''s see... messy, blurry and disorganized. Good! I have no idea what I''m looking at, so I''ll call thisan abstract. I''m not really engaged by this ''tho, but it is interesting to behold. Easily above average IMO.</td>', 'Let''s see... messy, blurry and disorganized. Good! I have no idea what I''m looking at, so I''ll call thisan abstract. I''m not really engaged by this ''tho, but it is interesting to behold. Easily above average IMO.', '2008-03-13 13:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4561651, 654930, 90394, '<td valign="top">Fits the bill nicely! I like it, and it stands out among many of the entries. Nicely done!</td>', 'Fits the bill nicely! I like it, and it stands out among many of the entries. Nicely done!', '2008-03-13 13:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4561653, 655642, 70888, '<td valign="top">kool effect,not enuff subject matter in frame for me tho 5</td>', 'kool effect,not enuff subject matter in frame for me tho 5', '2008-03-13 13:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4561656, 656848, 70888, '<td valign="top">blurry,not messy or chaotic,lovely is more like it...5</td>', 'blurry,not messy or chaotic,lovely is more like it...5', '2008-03-13 13:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4561658, 657064, 90394, '<td valign="top">Well done! Now this is a great idea, and fits the theme comfortably, but with a little room left for the "messy" aspect, which is what makes this challenge so difficult to score. Definitely above average in this challenge! Call me engaged, too!<br/> <br/>More "unintended" consequence would have sold me on the messy aspect, however, so I''m not awarding points for creativity on what is otherwise another simple abstract of light in this challenge. An element of the unpredictable would have added to this. <br/> <br/>Your use of engine vibration to distort and move light gives this slight seperation from the more common abstracts though.</td>', 'Well done! Now this is a great idea, and fits the theme comfortably, but with a little room left for the "messy" aspect, which is what makes this challenge so difficult to score. Definitely above average in this challenge! Call me engaged, too! More "unintended" consequence would have sold me on the messy aspect, however, so I''m not awarding points for creativity on what is otherwise another simple abstract of light in this challenge. An element of the unpredictable would have added to this.  Your use of engine vibration to distort and move light gives this slight seperation from the more common abstracts though.', '2008-03-13 13:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4561660, 656686, 90394, '<td valign="top">I''m looking for more chaotic elements to these shots, and you had a nice start with the cracked glass and shards. If you''d have taken that aspect a bit further, I have no problem with the crack (and shards) being in focus. However, I was also looking for creative use of the theme, and this is encouraging, since many used more conventional ideas. This slightly above average, and could have been taken up a couple notches. Overall, a good entry!</td>', 'I''m looking for more chaotic elements to these shots, and you had a nice start with the cracked glass and shards. If you''d have taken that aspect a bit further, I have no problem with the crack (and shards) being in focus. However, I was also looking for creative use of the theme, and this is encouraging, since many used more conventional ideas. This slightly above average, and could have been taken up a couple notches. Overall, a good entry!', '2008-03-13 13:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4561661, 655020, 90394, '<td valign="top">Chaotic, interesting and blurry. Another challenging entry to score - Hmmm... This might have benefitted from a bit more intensity in the color, but that may have hurt the blurry aspect. I like looking at this, but wouldn''t qualify it as overtly "engaging". Overall, however, I''d call this an above average entry, considering the many simply "messy" shots. Nice!<br/> <br/>This would have fit more comfortably in a simple "abstract" challenge, however, since the consequences of light and color seem more "planned" here.</td>', 'Chaotic, interesting and blurry. Another challenging entry to score - Hmmm... This might have benefitted from a bit more intensity in the color, but that may have hurt the blurry aspect. I like looking at this, but wouldn''t qualify it as overtly "engaging". Overall, however, I''d call this an above average entry, considering the many simply "messy" shots. Nice! This would have fit more comfortably in a simple "abstract" challenge, however, since the consequences of light and color seem more "planned" here.', '2008-03-13 13:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4561662, 657132, 90394, '<td valign="top">These commom abstracts are fine to behold, for sure, but I was looking for more creative usage of the Blurry Mess license. Not that this isn''t fun to look at, nor that it doesn''t contain elements of the challenge stipulations -it''s just that this could have easily been in some other abstract challenge.<br/> <br/>I''m looking for more unconventional, even <i>literal</i> use of the theme to seperate the wheat from the chaff in this challenge - and that''s what makes this challenge so inherently difficult, and difficult to score.<br/> <br/>Overall a beautiful abstract, that would have gotten high points elsewhere, but only slightly above average for this particular challenge.</td>', 'These commom abstracts are fine to behold, for sure, but I was looking for more creative usage of the Blurry Mess license. Not that this isn''t fun to look at, nor that it doesn''t contain elements of the challenge stipulations -it''s just that this could have easily been in some other abstract challenge. I''m looking for more unconventional, even literal use of the theme to seperate the wheat from the chaff in this challenge - and that''s what makes this challenge so inherently difficult, and difficult to score. Overall a beautiful abstract, that would have gotten high points elsewhere, but only slightly above average for this particular challenge.', '2008-03-13 13:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4561663, 657042, 70888, '<td valign="top">the tight crop around the subject and the DOF makes this difficult to look at</td>', 'the tight crop around the subject and the DOF makes this difficult to look at', '2008-03-13 13:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
