(4563346, 655583, 82707, '<td valign="top">Great interpretation and execution of the subject.  Added to favs! Hope it does well!  Top marks from me.</td>', 'Great interpretation and execution of the subject.  Added to favs! Hope it does well!  Top marks from me.', '2008-03-14 08:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563348, 656856, 38032, '<td valign="top">It is close to looking like other things so leading the view in another direction would have been interesting.  This works but isn''t quite the madness I think of as a mess.  That said, it''s appealing and somewhat original for this challenge.</td>', 'It is close to looking like other things so leading the view in another direction would have been interesting.  This works but isn''t quite the madness I think of as a mess.  That said, it''s appealing and somewhat original for this challenge.', '2008-03-14 08:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
