(4563734, 657116, 40484, '<td valign="top">like the soft focus for the flower but find the composition not to my preference. Perhaps shifting the rose center to a more offset position would improve the imapact of the shot.</td>', 'like the soft focus for the flower but find the composition not to my preference. Perhaps shifting the rose center to a more offset position would improve the imapact of the shot.', '2008-03-14 10:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
