(4563767, 656564, 41999, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. I would like it even more were it cropped to eliminate the dark spot in the lower left, which I find somewhat distracting</td>', 'I like this a lot. I would like it even more were it cropped to eliminate the dark spot in the lower left, which I find somewhat distracting', '2008-03-14 11:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563784, 656845, 69368, '<td valign="top">beautiful composition in color!</td>', 'beautiful composition in color!', '2008-03-14 11:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563825, 657030, 50641, '<td valign="top">this would be really cool zoomed in a bit more!</td>', 'this would be really cool zoomed in a bit more!', '2008-03-14 11:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563826, 656679, 50641, '<td valign="top">great!</td>', 'great!', '2008-03-14 11:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563867, 657063, 68256, '<td valign="top">When this challenge was announced your photo is what I had in my mind...except with warm tones.  You have captured it perfectly.  It is simple, flowing and beautiful.  Very well done.</td>', 'When this challenge was announced your photo is what I had in my mind...except with warm tones.  You have captured it perfectly.  It is simple, flowing and beautiful.  Very well done.', '2008-03-14 12:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563873, 656084, 34255, '<td valign="top">I like your interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'I like your interpretation of the challenge.', '2008-03-14 12:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563876, 656354, 68256, '<td valign="top">You have shown the business of the diner very well....I like the colors, tones, composition, and story very much.  Suites my taste greatly.</td>', 'You have shown the business of the diner very well....I like the colors, tones, composition, and story very much.  Suites my taste greatly.', '2008-03-14 12:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563879, 657023, 34255, '<td valign="top">The "Panning" challenge was several weeks ago...</td>', 'The "Panning" challenge was several weeks ago...', '2008-03-14 12:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563881, 655277, 68256, '<td valign="top">There should be no reason that I like this so much :) 8</td>', 'There should be no reason that I like this so much :) 8', '2008-03-14 12:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563888, 656860, 68256, '<td valign="top">I really like this composition, but the circular blur (I would have prefered a more natural chaotic blur) and tight crop bring my vote down a bit.  I''m giving it a 7 though because it really is lovely.</td>', 'I really like this composition, but the circular blur (I would have prefered a more natural chaotic blur) and tight crop bring my vote down a bit.  I''m giving it a 7 though because it really is lovely.', '2008-03-14 12:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563895, 657092, 34255, '<td valign="top">Not exactly a mess, but I like the colors.</td>', 'Not exactly a mess, but I like the colors.', '2008-03-14 12:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563900, 655721, 68256, '<td valign="top">Awesome...I love this shot and is a 10 in my book.  The blur in this is perfect and the tones wonderful.  I can just imagine your excitement when you saw this for the first time on your monitor (or perhaps the LCD!).  I would have been so pleased!</td>', 'Awesome...I love this shot and is a 10 in my book.  The blur in this is perfect and the tones wonderful.  I can just imagine your excitement when you saw this for the first time on your monitor (or perhaps the LCD!).  I would have been so pleased!', '2008-03-14 12:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563903, 656802, 68256, '<td valign="top">Great example of using blur as a technique to add emotion and drama to the photo.  Maybe it is getting some dnmc, but certainly not from me...I love this blurry mess and the traditional photographic use of it.</td>', 'Great example of using blur as a technique to add emotion and drama to the photo.  Maybe it is getting some dnmc, but certainly not from me...I love this blurry mess and the traditional photographic use of it.', '2008-03-14 12:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563907, 656930, 68256, '<td valign="top">The colors are truly terrific..so much so that I would have prefered a full frame of it!  The white background takes away from those wonderful pastels.</td>', 'The colors are truly terrific..so much so that I would have prefered a full frame of it!  The white background takes away from those wonderful pastels.', '2008-03-14 12:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563912, 655018, 68256, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting shot..I love the repeating patterns of the lights.  I haven''t liked a whole lot of the camera shake shots, but this one is very well executed and really makes a nice photo.</td>', 'This is a very interesting shot..I love the repeating patterns of the lights.  I haven''t liked a whole lot of the camera shake shots, but this one is very well executed and really makes a nice photo.', '2008-03-14 12:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563914, 656845, 68256, '<td valign="top">Oh yea!  Great filling of the frame and smooth color transitions.  I love this one.</td>', 'Oh yea!  Great filling of the frame and smooth color transitions.  I love this one.', '2008-03-14 12:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563921, 657140, 68256, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome composition and the blur really enhances the shot.  I can just imagine that you are getting "too in focus" voting, but I like it and the amount of blur.</td>', 'This is an awesome composition and the blur really enhances the shot.  I can just imagine that you are getting "too in focus" voting, but I like it and the amount of blur.', '2008-03-14 12:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563926, 657020, 68256, '<td valign="top">You definitely got all those elements in there!  Initially I wanted to vote this down..well maybe a 5 or 6, but now that I''ve soaked it in I''m starting to appreciate it''s genius more....</td>', 'You definitely got all those elements in there!  Initially I wanted to vote this down..well maybe a 5 or 6, but now that I''ve soaked it in I''m starting to appreciate it''s genius more....', '2008-03-14 12:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563930, 656797, 68256, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture!  I like everything about this...focused chaotic blur is what I''d call it.</td>', 'Wonderful capture!  I like everything about this...focused chaotic blur is what I''d call it.', '2008-03-14 12:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563933, 655757, 68256, '<td valign="top">I''ve only voted on 7 of these blurry messes so far, but I really like this one the best.  The blur has purpose which enhances the scene.  I can feel the kid''s emotions from this.</td>', 'I''ve only voted on 7 of these blurry messes so far, but I really like this one the best.  The blur has purpose which enhances the scene.  I can feel the kid''s emotions from this.', '2008-03-14 12:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563940, 656990, 68256, '<td valign="top">Those are some mighty beautiful colors!  I''m such a sucker for warm tones...9  Ps. I like the composition as well and the "just enough" lines to draw attention throughout the photo as well so it isn''t just your colors I like.<br/> <br/>Edit, well I''m back already and I gotta say this deserves a 10 rather than 9.</td>', 'Those are some mighty beautiful colors!  I''m such a sucker for warm tones...9  Ps. I like the composition as well and the "just enough" lines to draw attention throughout the photo as well so it isn''t just your colors I like. Edit, well I''m back already and I gotta say this deserves a 10 rather than 9.', '2008-03-14 12:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563942, 656087, 68256, '<td valign="top">I really love the pastels here and the fluid motion.</td>', 'I really love the pastels here and the fluid motion.', '2008-03-14 12:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563963, 656312, 83313, '<td valign="top">Well, there''s a lot of out of focus blur here, but I''m not finding it too chaotic. A nice plant macro, and I like it, but I don''t find it meeting the challenge, I''m afraid.</td>', 'Well, there''s a lot of out of focus blur here, but I''m not finding it too chaotic. A nice plant macro, and I like it, but I don''t find it meeting the challenge, I''m afraid.', '2008-03-14 13:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563969, 656845, 83313, '<td valign="top">Just enough blur to meet the challenge, but a good job. I think you have a combination of out of focus and camera shake going on here.</td>', 'Just enough blur to meet the challenge, but a good job. I think you have a combination of out of focus and camera shake going on here.', '2008-03-14 13:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563973, 656976, 83313, '<td valign="top">Man it''s hard to rate something that would be brown ribbon material in any other challenge! I suppose a blurry mess can also be sexy and enticing.</td>', 'Man it''s hard to rate something that would be brown ribbon material in any other challenge! I suppose a blurry mess can also be sexy and enticing.', '2008-03-14 13:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563977, 656811, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not so much mess, but certainly blurry, fascinating and a little scary. Good job on this.</td>', 'Not so much mess, but certainly blurry, fascinating and a little scary. Good job on this.', '2008-03-14 13:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563983, 655446, 83313, '<td valign="top">Ok, something was left in the road, but I can''t quite make out what it is. A recumbent bicycle? A wheelchair? Shopping cart?</td>', 'Ok, something was left in the road, but I can''t quite make out what it is. A recumbent bicycle? A wheelchair? Shopping cart?', '2008-03-14 13:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563985, 657110, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very calming. This would make a good desktop background.</td>', 'Very calming. This would make a good desktop background.', '2008-03-14 13:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563987, 655470, 83313, '<td valign="top">A good blurry mess, though I personally don''t find it wows me.</td>', 'A good blurry mess, though I personally don''t find it wows me.', '2008-03-14 13:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4563989, 657130, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good title for this. I like it.</td>', 'Good title for this. I like it.', '2008-03-14 13:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
