(4565830, 657062, 9462, '<td valign="top">I love the tilt, grain, blur and title; everything is just right! Truly the quintessential of a blurry mess. <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=670650" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5000-9999/9462/120/670650.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5000-9999/9462/120/670650.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5000-9999/9462/120/670650.jpg"/></a> <br/>Good luck!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-05-14 12:32:55.</i></td>', 'I love the tilt, grain, blur and title; everything is just right! Truly the quintessential of a blurry mess.  Good luck!', '2008-03-15 18:33:28.000000', '2008-05-14 13:32:55.000000', 1),
