(4566007, 656898, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is a very intentional looking blur with a motion pan effect. It''s a very realistic sort of chaotic, if you know what I mean... like you''re capturing the motion that an actual glimpse would reveal. Normally I might not like the background cows and people, but they help fulfill the challenge better. Even so, it''s a picture that stands on its own merits, even without the challenge.<br/> <br/>No runner up for you. This is the Posthumous Blue Ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'This is a very intentional looking blur with a motion pan effect. It''s a very realistic sort of chaotic, if you know what I mean... like you''re capturing the motion that an actual glimpse would reveal. Normally I might not like the background cows and people, but they help fulfill the challenge better. Even so, it''s a picture that stands on its own merits, even without the challenge. No runner up for you. This is the Posthumous Blue Ribbon. ', '2008-03-15 19:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
