(4566848, 657104, 7743, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I think, due to the form being more vertical in nature, the image should have a vertical format to emphasize it.</td>', 'Interesting.  I think, due to the form being more vertical in nature, the image should have a vertical format to emphasize it.', '2008-03-16 00:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
