(4569999, 656354, 45475, '<td valign="top">Back to comment and bump up :) My first thoughts upon seeing this, went immediately to Edward Hopper. Almost an inside out possible scene from Nighthawks. The motion is just enough to give it a painterly feel and not too much that it would blur the individual characters within. The strong colour and light add much to the sense of looking in on a bygone era. I feel this is one of the more well thought out and purposeful entries in this challenge and wish you the best of luck.</td>', 'Back to comment and bump up :) My first thoughts upon seeing this, went immediately to Edward Hopper. Almost an inside out possible scene from Nighthawks. The motion is just enough to give it a painterly feel and not too much that it would blur the individual characters within. The strong colour and light add much to the sense of looking in on a bygone era. I feel this is one of the more well thought out and purposeful entries in this challenge and wish you the best of luck.', '2008-03-17 19:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4570208, 655095, 91150, '<td valign="top">lol Look! Shiny! hehe</td>', 'lol Look! Shiny! hehe', '2008-03-17 21:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
