(4570466, 656833, 12661, '<td valign="top">The Minute Maid machine is greatly overexposed compared to the Powerade giving a very unbalanced feel. Also, the cartwheeler is barely visible. The idea was solid, unfortunately, the execution is very difficult.</td>', 'The Minute Maid machine is greatly overexposed compared to the Powerade giving a very unbalanced feel. Also, the cartwheeler is barely visible. The idea was solid, unfortunately, the execution is very difficult.', '2008-03-17 23:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4570474, 656543, 12661, '<td valign="top">As an abstract, this is very nice. I particularly like the radiating lines from the bottom center. The green and the purple complement each other nicely as well. My only negatives are that I would have preferred a lighter green to match the brightness of the purple as well as more of it. <br/>On a side note, I wish I could tell what it is that you are photographing. That is just my personal conflict with abstracts and sure to drive my crazy as I keep voting in this challenge.</td>', 'As an abstract, this is very nice. I particularly like the radiating lines from the bottom center. The green and the purple complement each other nicely as well. My only negatives are that I would have preferred a lighter green to match the brightness of the purple as well as more of it. On a side note, I wish I could tell what it is that you are photographing. That is just my personal conflict with abstracts and sure to drive my crazy as I keep voting in this challenge.', '2008-03-17 23:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4570478, 656856, 12661, '<td valign="top">The image is crisp and clean. There are no unpleasant distractions, yet there is also little to grab a viewer''s interest.</td>', 'The image is crisp and clean. There are no unpleasant distractions, yet there is also little to grab a viewer''s interest.', '2008-03-17 23:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4570495, 656998, 12661, '<td valign="top">This image has an appropriate use of DOF to suit the subject and not just the challenge. I also like the contrast in the clouds and the way the rusty barbed wire ties in with the color of the building. If the scene allowed it, shifting the shot to the right so that the green structure on the left could have been omitted might have helped.</td>', 'This image has an appropriate use of DOF to suit the subject and not just the challenge. I also like the contrast in the clouds and the way the rusty barbed wire ties in with the color of the building. If the scene allowed it, shifting the shot to the right so that the green structure on the left could have been omitted might have helped.', '2008-03-17 23:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4570503, 656004, 12661, '<td valign="top">After seeing countless images of blurry <u><b>MESS</b></u>, it is nice to see a few that are <u><b>BLURRY</b></u> mess. The motion you introduced into this photo gives a fantasy like feeling, almost calming and serene. It actually gives me more of the impression of a northern pine forest rather then a rain forest, though. Makes me want to look for a pot of gold (I should stop commenting on St. Patrick''s Day). <br/> <br/>The only detraction is the top right corner. The beige doesn''t seem to tie in with the rest of the photo. Still very nice overall.</td>', 'After seeing countless images of blurry MESS, it is nice to see a few that are BLURRY mess. The motion you introduced into this photo gives a fantasy like feeling, almost calming and serene. It actually gives me more of the impression of a northern pine forest rather then a rain forest, though. Makes me want to look for a pot of gold (I should stop commenting on St. Patrick''s Day).  The only detraction is the top right corner. The beige doesn''t seem to tie in with the rest of the photo. Still very nice overall.', '2008-03-17 23:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4570513, 656973, 12661, '<td valign="top">At first glance my mind jumped to ''yup, another featureless blurry photo'' but then I read the title and the image took on instant meaning. Very nice use of the blur to show a sense of urgency.</td>', 'At first glance my mind jumped to ''yup, another featureless blurry photo'' but then I read the title and the image took on instant meaning. Very nice use of the blur to show a sense of urgency.', '2008-03-17 23:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4570520, 656783, 12661, '<td valign="top">I spent a good bit of time staring at this photo trying to place a story on it.  The image I came away with is a spirit emerging from a mine shaft. I don''t know if that was your intent, but the more I look at it, the clearer I see it (time to move to the next image I suppose). As far as detractions, the light squiggle near the bottom left and the hot squiggle near the top are somewhat bothersome.</td>', 'I spent a good bit of time staring at this photo trying to place a story on it.  The image I came away with is a spirit emerging from a mine shaft. I don''t know if that was your intent, but the more I look at it, the clearer I see it (time to move to the next image I suppose). As far as detractions, the light squiggle near the bottom left and the hot squiggle near the top are somewhat bothersome.', '2008-03-17 23:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4570521, 656675, 12661, '<td valign="top">This image would have worked better for me if there was something to ground it to. A wider crop placing some background into focus would have given more emphasis to the motion of the carousel.</td>', 'This image would have worked better for me if there was something to ground it to. A wider crop placing some background into focus would have given more emphasis to the motion of the carousel.', '2008-03-17 23:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4570527, 657002, 62249, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see better tonal range in this (too murky without real highlights &amp; shadows), but the composition itself is quite lovely.</td>', 'I''d like to see better tonal range in this (too murky without real highlights & shadows), but the composition itself is quite lovely.', '2008-03-17 23:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4570540, 656230, 62249, '<td valign="top">The beaters are great. I like the B/W effect contrasting w/ the yellow of the mixer.</td>', 'The beaters are great. I like the B/W effect contrasting w/ the yellow of the mixer.', '2008-03-18 00:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
