(4570761, 654852, 57229, '<td valign="top">Fairly well-defined noise and a more or less organised dark/light graduation. The border is ghastly, but deliberate. The blurry mess is in my own judgement, not knowing whether to vote 1 or 10. I ain''t sayin.</td>', 'Fairly well-defined noise and a more or less organised dark/light graduation. The border is ghastly, but deliberate. The blurry mess is in my own judgement, not knowing whether to vote 1 or 10. I ain''t sayin.', '2008-03-18 07:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4570762, 656908, 57229, '<td valign="top">Drama is definitely a way to go with this challenge. Blurred, slightly messy, not very chaotic. Engaging and interesting, check. 4 out of 5 ain''t bad. Extra point for the fact that blur enhances this.</td>', 'Drama is definitely a way to go with this challenge. Blurred, slightly messy, not very chaotic. Engaging and interesting, check. 4 out of 5 ain''t bad. Extra point for the fact that blur enhances this.', '2008-03-18 07:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4570764, 657119, 57229, '<td valign="top">Coming back to add the ''blur bonus'' - i.e. to note that the effect of this picture is enhanced by the blur. It wouldn''t have worked as well without it. That''s a challenge response star, about as easy to catch as falling ones.</td>', 'Coming back to add the ''blur bonus'' - i.e. to note that the effect of this picture is enhanced by the blur. It wouldn''t have worked as well without it. That''s a challenge response star, about as easy to catch as falling ones.', '2008-03-18 07:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4570766, 656815, 57229, '<td valign="top">Title cops out, imo, but it''s a magnificent picture that uses blur etc to make a picture that wouldn''t work without it. Kudos, coming back for the challenge response bonus.</td>', 'Title cops out, imo, but it''s a magnificent picture that uses blur etc to make a picture that wouldn''t work without it. Kudos, coming back for the challenge response bonus.', '2008-03-18 07:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4570768, 656002, 57229, '<td valign="top">V lovely shot. Could be it''s too blurred for any other challenge and not messy enough for this one, but no one can take the beauty of it away from you.</td>', 'V lovely shot. Could be it''s too blurred for any other challenge and not messy enough for this one, but no one can take the beauty of it away from you.', '2008-03-18 07:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4570769, 656888, 57229, '<td valign="top">Horrible title, lovely picture. Abstract elements work together. Maybe that defeats the ''chaos'' bit, but that''s probably what''s supposed to happen.</td>', 'Horrible title, lovely picture. Abstract elements work together. Maybe that defeats the ''chaos'' bit, but that''s probably what''s supposed to happen.', '2008-03-18 07:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4570771, 656799, 57229, '<td valign="top">This is dynamite with the placing, attitudes, etc of the people. A bit off the beam of the challenge, what with neither blur nor chaos (or mess) but it''s a great pic.</td>', 'This is dynamite with the placing, attitudes, etc of the people. A bit off the beam of the challenge, what with neither blur nor chaos (or mess) but it''s a great pic.', '2008-03-18 07:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4570829, 657140, 32011, '<td valign="top">GREAT concept.  Well executed... this has to get a ribbon.  I love the coloured rings and the dark floor, all of which add to the desired effect and to the aesthetic appeal of this photo.</td>', 'GREAT concept.  Well executed... this has to get a ribbon.  I love the coloured rings and the dark floor, all of which add to the desired effect and to the aesthetic appeal of this photo.', '2008-03-18 08:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
