(4570832, 655721, 32011, '<td valign="top">Nice photo... you''ve created a piece of art.  A beautiful scene, and the blurriness adds to the viewing pleasure... something very few others were able to do in this challenge.</td>', 'Nice photo... you''ve created a piece of art.  A beautiful scene, and the blurriness adds to the viewing pleasure... something very few others were able to do in this challenge.', '2008-03-18 08:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
