(4570916, 657130, 65234, '<td valign="top">Pretty!!!  This works as an abstract and as a soft portrayal of spring flowers.  The bits of stem keep me from thinking "flame" which is what springs to mind when I scroll them off the screen, but that would work, too, in its own way.  Great job :-)</td>', 'Pretty!!!  This works as an abstract and as a soft portrayal of spring flowers.  The bits of stem keep me from thinking "flame" which is what springs to mind when I scroll them off the screen, but that would work, too, in its own way.  Great job :-)', '2008-03-18 09:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4570917, 657063, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice abstract.  Still a bit of texture in the grasses, and ghosts of them reaching into the sky.</td>', 'Very nice abstract.  Still a bit of texture in the grasses, and ghosts of them reaching into the sky.', '2008-03-18 09:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
