(4571315, 657141, 91147, '<td valign="top">By far my favorite of the challenge. The texture of the tree really helps the flow of the motion blur. The tone, while somewhat unnatural for the subject, fits right into this composition. Great job! 10</td>', 'By far my favorite of the challenge. The texture of the tree really helps the flow of the motion blur. The tone, while somewhat unnatural for the subject, fits right into this composition. Great job! 10', '2008-03-18 13:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
