(4571473, 656166, 91147, '<td valign="top">Love the long exposure, must be in a river. You captured such detail in the texture of the water, yet it reminds me of a painting with long ''brush strokes''. One of my favorites of the challenge. Great job!</td>', 'Love the long exposure, must be in a river. You captured such detail in the texture of the water, yet it reminds me of a painting with long ''brush strokes''. One of my favorites of the challenge. Great job!', '2008-03-18 14:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4571474, 656686, 54398, '<td valign="top">i think that if the glass would have been cleaner, it would have been a great shot</td>', 'i think that if the glass would have been cleaner, it would have been a great shot', '2008-03-18 14:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4571477, 657083, 91147, '<td valign="top">WOW</td>', 'WOW', '2008-03-18 14:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4571484, 656084, 91147, '<td valign="top">Perfect use of shallow depth of field here. The blurred drops are beautiful yet you have just enough in focus to let the viewer understand the composition. Great job</td>', 'Perfect use of shallow depth of field here. The blurred drops are beautiful yet you have just enough in focus to let the viewer understand the composition. Great job', '2008-03-18 14:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4571493, 655351, 54398, '<td valign="top">love the poster!</td>', 'love the poster!', '2008-03-18 14:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4571495, 656985, 91147, '<td valign="top">Oh my... What a fantastic macro abstract. The colors, lines and vague shapes work extremely well together. Reminds me of Apple''s backgrounds. The only thing I am not sure about is the vignette but I suppose theres not much you can do about that with basic editing. Great job!</td>', 'Oh my... What a fantastic macro abstract. The colors, lines and vague shapes work extremely well together. Reminds me of Apple''s backgrounds. The only thing I am not sure about is the vignette but I suppose theres not much you can do about that with basic editing. Great job!', '2008-03-18 14:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4571507, 656087, 91147, '<td valign="top">Yikes, I feel like I am falling. I think I am in love with the texture, it reminds of of curtains for some reason... The color is what sells the image though, brings the whole image together. My mind fails me trying to imagine what was in front of the lens. Great job!</td>', 'Yikes, I feel like I am falling. I think I am in love with the texture, it reminds of of curtains for some reason... The color is what sells the image though, brings the whole image together. My mind fails me trying to imagine what was in front of the lens. Great job!', '2008-03-18 15:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4571510, 656567, 91147, '<td valign="top">I am guessing flowers? Zoom blur is always fun, and you got a great image from it. Good job.</td>', 'I am guessing flowers? Zoom blur is always fun, and you got a great image from it. Good job.', '2008-03-18 15:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4571514, 656290, 91147, '<td valign="top">I really like the flow of this image. I just can''t get past the CCD dust though.</td>', 'I really like the flow of this image. I just can''t get past the CCD dust though.', '2008-03-18 15:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4571524, 656990, 91147, '<td valign="top">Good choice with focus on this one, just enough DOF to get the lines and shapes without having anything sharp. The color also works out really well</td>', 'Good choice with focus on this one, just enough DOF to get the lines and shapes without having anything sharp. The color also works out really well', '2008-03-18 15:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4571531, 657044, 91147, '<td valign="top">Zoom blur is fun but I don''t think it really works in this particular composition.</td>', 'Zoom blur is fun but I don''t think it really works in this particular composition.', '2008-03-18 15:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4571535, 657095, 90892, '<td valign="top">Blurry, chaotic, engaging Good job I give an 8 and may bump up on further review. Nice range of tones. The colors could pop a little more. Upon further review I am bumping this up 1 point.</td>', 'Blurry, chaotic, engaging Good job I give an 8 and may bump up on further review. Nice range of tones. The colors could pop a little more. Upon further review I am bumping this up 1 point.', '2008-03-18 15:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
