(4571538, 656808, 90892, '<td valign="top">colr is a bit dull but I love the way the composition looks and this fits the challenge. Upon further review I am bumping this up one point. final review and in light of the other entries I am bumping this to a 10</td>', 'colr is a bit dull but I love the way the composition looks and this fits the challenge. Upon further review I am bumping this up one point. final review and in light of the other entries I am bumping this to a 10', '2008-03-18 15:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
