(4571542, 655757, 90892, '<td valign="top">I like this alot. It definitely invokes a lonely feeling. It''s blurry and the snow adds the chaos. I give an 8 and may bump upon further review. Upon further review I am bumping this to 9</td>', 'I like this alot. It definitely invokes a lonely feeling. It''s blurry and the snow adds the chaos. I give an 8 and may bump upon further review. Upon further review I am bumping this to 9', '2008-03-18 15:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
