(4571787, 655494, 91147, '<td valign="top">Let me guess, bucket of nails? Very busy image, I almost think more blur would even out some of the strong edges. I like were this was going but I don''t think it quite hit the mark.</td>', 'Let me guess, bucket of nails? Very busy image, I almost think more blur would even out some of the strong edges. I like were this was going but I don''t think it quite hit the mark.', '2008-03-18 17:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4571793, 657078, 91147, '<td valign="top">Wow, were did you find this combination of colors and textures? They both work really well to create a great abstract. Great job!</td>', 'Wow, were did you find this combination of colors and textures? They both work really well to create a great abstract. Great job!', '2008-03-18 17:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4571799, 656382, 91147, '<td valign="top">Yikes! What a busy image, it kind of hurts my eyes. Its also freaking my out, I keep seeing a guy in the upper right corner. Other then that I have no idea what is going on, nor do I know how you did it. Over all it is certainly blurry, although surprisingly sharp.</td>', 'Yikes! What a busy image, it kind of hurts my eyes. Its also freaking my out, I keep seeing a guy in the upper right corner. Other then that I have no idea what is going on, nor do I know how you did it. Over all it is certainly blurry, although surprisingly sharp.', '2008-03-18 17:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4571800, 656674, 91147, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what this is. What I do know is that it is a beautiful abstract.</td>', 'I have no idea what this is. What I do know is that it is a beautiful abstract.', '2008-03-18 17:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4571805, 657020, 91147, '<td valign="top">Nice long exposure but not really a blurry mess. Only blur I see is the water,  really only being smoothed out, then the tree which I only can figure is blurred from the wind. Everything is sharp which does not fit well with the challenge.</td>', 'Nice long exposure but not really a blurry mess. Only blur I see is the water,  really only being smoothed out, then the tree which I only can figure is blurred from the wind. Everything is sharp which does not fit well with the challenge.', '2008-03-18 17:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4571812, 656156, 91147, '<td valign="top">Wow, that must have been a really long exposure. The model held his face amazingly still. I like the use of red and blue, creates a sharp contrast. Might have actually fit more with the contest without the model.</td>', 'Wow, that must have been a really long exposure. The model held his face amazingly still. I like the use of red and blue, creates a sharp contrast. Might have actually fit more with the contest without the model.', '2008-03-18 17:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4571817, 656757, 91147, '<td valign="top">Not sure what to think about this one. I''m thinking more blur would have been nice to smooth out some of the details. I really like the colors though, then again I am a sucker for blue. Still a good shot.</td>', 'Not sure what to think about this one. I''m thinking more blur would have been nice to smooth out some of the details. I really like the colors though, then again I am a sucker for blue. Still a good shot.', '2008-03-18 17:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4571818, 656802, 91147, '<td valign="top">I hate voting based on being too sharp because mine is too, but I am afraid I am forced to. Nice shot, but not for this challenge.</td>', 'I hate voting based on being too sharp because mine is too, but I am afraid I am forced to. Nice shot, but not for this challenge.', '2008-03-18 17:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4571822, 655857, 91147, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, good color and texture. I probably would have used a tripod with the zoom blur to create straiter lines. The whole image reminds me of fire, I think the light might be a bit too clear. Still a great shot, good job.</td>', 'Very nice shot, good color and texture. I probably would have used a tripod with the zoom blur to create straiter lines. The whole image reminds me of fire, I think the light might be a bit too clear. Still a great shot, good job.', '2008-03-18 17:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4571823, 655603, 91147, '<td valign="top">Interesting texture, looks like an abstract painting. Just sharp enough for me to figure out what is in the composition yet still mysterious to be interesting. Good job!</td>', 'Interesting texture, looks like an abstract painting. Just sharp enough for me to figure out what is in the composition yet still mysterious to be interesting. Good job!', '2008-03-18 17:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4571831, 657130, 91147, '<td valign="top">Excellent texture, color and flow. Reminds me of a abstract painting, more specifically roses.</td>', 'Excellent texture, color and flow. Reminds me of a abstract painting, more specifically roses.', '2008-03-18 17:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
