(4571973, 656290, 44611, '<td valign="top">Perfect combination - messy and blurry, and yet artistically interesting.  Fascinating even.  I can''t figure out what the subject was ... hope all is revealed later.</td>', 'Perfect combination - messy and blurry, and yet artistically interesting.  Fascinating even.  I can''t figure out what the subject was ... hope all is revealed later.', '2008-03-18 19:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
