(4571983, 657130, 44611, '<td valign="top">Looks just like a painting.  Definitely blurry, although perhaps not ultimately messy - the subject would be evident even without your title.   You''ve gone a very similar route to my own entry in this challenge, using colour strongly which I think was vital to achieving an interesting enough composition which also met the challenge guidelines.</td>', 'Looks just like a painting.  Definitely blurry, although perhaps not ultimately messy - the subject would be evident even without your title.   You''ve gone a very similar route to my own entry in this challenge, using colour strongly which I think was vital to achieving an interesting enough composition which also met the challenge guidelines.', '2008-03-18 19:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4571986, 656797, 44611, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful colours.  Blurry.  Not awfully messy.  I like it though.</td>', 'Very beautiful colours.  Blurry.  Not awfully messy.  I like it though.', '2008-03-18 19:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
