(4572263, 656086, 12661, '<td valign="top">I was just reading an article in Popular Photography about capturing butterflies in flight rather that static on a flower. Ironically, they recommended shooting with fast shutter speed to avoid blur, but that wouldn''t work very well in the challenge I suppose. Regardless, the colors are well balanced, as is the exposure. And the motion in the wings does give it a dynamic sense. Well done.</td>', 'I was just reading an article in Popular Photography about capturing butterflies in flight rather that static on a flower. Ironically, they recommended shooting with fast shutter speed to avoid blur, but that wouldn''t work very well in the challenge I suppose. Regardless, the colors are well balanced, as is the exposure. And the motion in the wings does give it a dynamic sense. Well done.', '2008-03-18 21:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
