(4572338, 655721, 61651, '<td valign="top">Great feel of a rainy day, the blurriness is the point of this shot.  Nice arrangement of elements in your composition.  Another of my 10s for this challenge.</td>', 'Great feel of a rainy day, the blurriness is the point of this shot.  Nice arrangement of elements in your composition.  Another of my 10s for this challenge.', '2008-03-18 22:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
