(4572354, 656985, 61651, '<td valign="top">Nicely delicate - another of my 10s for the challenge.</td>', 'Nicely delicate - another of my 10s for the challenge.', '2008-03-18 22:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572357, 654994, 61651, '<td valign="top">Black frame seems right for this, and I like your choice to catch the fish coming and going out of the edges of the composition. I feel like I have my nose pressed right up against the glass. 10</td>', 'Black frame seems right for this, and I like your choice to catch the fish coming and going out of the edges of the composition. I feel like I have my nose pressed right up against the glass. 10', '2008-03-18 22:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572363, 656312, 61651, '<td valign="top">I suppose that some might not find this blurry (or messy) enough, but I like it - the abstract quality appeals to me.  My only quibble is that I''m not fond of the double border, although I can see why you might have chosen it - to make a sharper cutoff between the green on the left side and the white border, I''m guessing.  One of my 9s.</td>', 'I suppose that some might not find this blurry (or messy) enough, but I like it - the abstract quality appeals to me.  My only quibble is that I''m not fond of the double border, although I can see why you might have chosen it - to make a sharper cutoff between the green on the left side and the white border, I''m guessing.  One of my 9s.', '2008-03-18 22:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572368, 656002, 61651, '<td valign="top">I like how these birds form their own pattern over this image.  Nice motion capture.</td>', 'I like how these birds form their own pattern over this image.  Nice motion capture.', '2008-03-18 22:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572374, 655757, 61651, '<td valign="top">Very nice effect, here - it make me feel as if sleet is stinging my eyes.  I want to duck my head right along with him/her.  9</td>', 'Very nice effect, here - it make me feel as if sleet is stinging my eyes.  I want to duck my head right along with him/her.  9', '2008-03-18 22:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572380, 655351, 61651, '<td valign="top">A blurry picture of a mess!  I like this, especially the oversat quality to the colors.  My only quibble is that I personally would prefer to see the shot rotated a bit counter clockwise to straighten the most dominant and noticeable line in the composition - the long cabinet.  But then, maybe that would counteract the "messy" dynamic too much...  Well, anyway, I think this is a good shot for this challenge, gave it a 9.</td>', 'A blurry picture of a mess!  I like this, especially the oversat quality to the colors.  My only quibble is that I personally would prefer to see the shot rotated a bit counter clockwise to straighten the most dominant and noticeable line in the composition - the long cabinet.  But then, maybe that would counteract the "messy" dynamic too much...  Well, anyway, I think this is a good shot for this challenge, gave it a 9.', '2008-03-18 22:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572390, 656900, 61651, '<td valign="top">This is really great - the strong rich colors, the swirling motion capture - I especially love that marvelous long sweep from the top of the older girl''s head  down her arm and seemingly out through the sweep of both their skirts.  You could not have gotten the rhythm of the lines better if you had *drawn* this.  Tremendously emotive.</td>', 'This is really great - the strong rich colors, the swirling motion capture - I especially love that marvelous long sweep from the top of the older girl''s head  down her arm and seemingly out through the sweep of both their skirts.  You could not have gotten the rhythm of the lines better if you had *drawn* this.  Tremendously emotive.', '2008-03-18 22:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572391, 656584, 61651, '<td valign="top">Beautiful floral impressionism - like purple flames.  9</td>', 'Beautiful floral impressionism - like purple flames.  9', '2008-03-18 22:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572397, 657113, 61651, '<td valign="top">The are millions of ants in this picture!  The big shadowy guy is just a hint for all those who can''t have trouble seeing the swirling armies all around him.  Well, at least that''s how I see this image :)  - I''d be interested to know how you got this effect - is it all just noise, pixelation, or what?  Cool effect, in any case.  :)</td>', 'The are millions of ants in this picture!  The big shadowy guy is just a hint for all those who can''t have trouble seeing the swirling armies all around him.  Well, at least that''s how I see this image :)  - I''d be interested to know how you got this effect - is it all just noise, pixelation, or what?  Cool effect, in any case.  :)', '2008-03-18 22:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572400, 655018, 61651, '<td valign="top">Great - nice colorful progression through the frame, complemented by all those lilting notes.</td>', 'Great - nice colorful progression through the frame, complemented by all those lilting notes.', '2008-03-18 22:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572406, 655786, 61651, '<td valign="top">Like a cross between a Toulouse Lautrec and a Degas - effective motion blur and lighting - like she''s a dancer on a candlelit stage.  Beautiful - started at a 9, bumping to a 10.</td>', 'Like a cross between a Toulouse Lautrec and a Degas - effective motion blur and lighting - like she''s a dancer on a candlelit stage.  Beautiful - started at a 9, bumping to a 10.', '2008-03-18 23:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572409, 656567, 61651, '<td valign="top">Very colorful and appealing - I''d be interested to know what this actually is.</td>', 'Very colorful and appealing - I''d be interested to know what this actually is.', '2008-03-18 23:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4572416, 657085, 61651, '<td valign="top">Your technique has yielded a strange Cubist metamorphosis of these animals - it''s quite fascinating to look at.  Started at a 9, bumping to 10.</td>', 'Your technique has yielded a strange Cubist metamorphosis of these animals - it''s quite fascinating to look at.  Started at a 9, bumping to 10.', '2008-03-18 23:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
