(4572490, 656815, 67697, '<td valign="top">Well I guess as long as you do not fall into the blur then, you should be ok. :) I love the blur of the train but the bright spots above left pull my attention away from it.</td>', 'Well I guess as long as you do not fall into the blur then, you should be ok. :) I love the blur of the train but the bright spots above left pull my attention away from it.', '2008-03-18 23:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
