(4573025, 656676, 70514, '<td valign="top">Wow Michelle.  I absolutely love the processing in this image.  It''s absolutely lovely how soft and flowing the very white feathers are against the water all around.  Just stunning, quite underrated, imo.  Another very well executed image.</td>', 'Wow Michelle.  I absolutely love the processing in this image.  It''s absolutely lovely how soft and flowing the very white feathers are against the water all around.  Just stunning, quite underrated, imo.  Another very well executed image.', '2008-03-19 03:35:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4573030, 656544, 70514, '<td valign="top">There is something very lovely and engaging about reflections in puddles.  You''ve captured the foggy morning feel, thrown in with a little early morning wonder.  Lovely capture, even if not for the masses.</td>', 'There is something very lovely and engaging about reflections in puddles.  You''ve captured the foggy morning feel, thrown in with a little early morning wonder.  Lovely capture, even if not for the masses.', '2008-03-19 03:37:10.000000', NULL, 0),
