(4573061, 655313, 57229, '<td valign="top">I see you have comments saying it''s out of focus but not blurred. Pretty semantic stuff. As I''ve commented on a couple of other shots that seemed to fall outside the (stricter?) boundaries of the challenge, no one can take the beauty of the shot away from you.<br/>FWIW, being out of focus creates blur in my book :)</td>', 'I see you have comments saying it''s out of focus but not blurred. Pretty semantic stuff. As I''ve commented on a couple of other shots that seemed to fall outside the (stricter?) boundaries of the challenge, no one can take the beauty of the shot away from you.FWIW, being out of focus creates blur in my book :)', '2008-03-19 04:27:17.000000', NULL, 0),
