(4573215, 657113, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657241" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657241.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657241.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657241.jpg"/></a> ooo, wow, this just made me stop and gasp. the tones, grain, subject, composition... this is the kind of image that hurts to look at, because it''s just so damned wonderful, and i could look at it all day long.</td>', ' ooo, wow, this just made me stop and gasp. the tones, grain, subject, composition... this is the kind of image that hurts to look at, because it''s just so damned wonderful, and i could look at it all day long.', '2008-03-19 06:53:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4573218, 657104, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657242" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657242.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657242.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657242.jpg"/></a> a simply stunning image.  dark, soft, and truly sensual (in its proper meaning, although it''s sexy too).  for some reason i think of anaïs nin when i see this. which is a very good thing.</td>', ' a simply stunning image.  dark, soft, and truly sensual (in its proper meaning, although it''s sexy too).  for some reason i think of anaïs nin when i see this. which is a very good thing.', '2008-03-19 06:55:21.000000', NULL, 0),
