(4573241, 656567, 35602, '<td valign="top">In response to kronodil, the image is actually of a fly resting on a pink flower.  I decided to flip the image over so that it was actually upside down.  Made the image a bit more difficult to tell what it actually was.  I was very surprised at the score.  I have been sweating all week, figuring that with the uncomplimentary comments it would be lucky to hit even 10%.  So its placement was way better than I expected.  Thanks to all who saw the neat things I saw with this shot.</td>', 'In response to kronodil, the image is actually of a fly resting on a pink flower.  I decided to flip the image over so that it was actually upside down.  Made the image a bit more difficult to tell what it actually was.  I was very surprised at the score.  I have been sweating all week, figuring that with the uncomplimentary comments it would be lucky to hit even 10%.  So its placement was way better than I expected.  Thanks to all who saw the neat things I saw with this shot.', '2008-03-19 07:24:46.000000', NULL, 0),
