(4577059, 656558, 90892, '<td valign="top">If one of the people who gave an 8 would have given a 2 it would be a perfectly symmetrical voting curve That would have given you exactly a 5.0 (don''t know why I feel compelled to point this out) I guess I just find it interesting that just as many thought it a 6 as thought it a 4 and just as many thought it a 3 as thought it a 7. I guess it shows that average scores do not tell the tale of an image. For 72 people this image was above average. The glass is a tad more than half full.</td>', 'If one of the people who gave an 8 would have given a 2 it would be a perfectly symmetrical voting curve That would have given you exactly a 5.0 (don''t know why I feel compelled to point this out) I guess I just find it interesting that just as many thought it a 6 as thought it a 4 and just as many thought it a 3 as thought it a 7. I guess it shows that average scores do not tell the tale of an image. For 72 people this image was above average. The glass is a tad more than half full.', '2008-03-20 14:30:41.000000', NULL, 0),
