(4578638, 656676, 68035, '<td valign="top">Well I think you can feel hard done by with this shot, like you I love the melding of the feathers and the waves as well as the fact that is stands alone as an interesting image outside of the challenge<br/> <br/>Interesting Bell curve on the votes you got, nice to see that there were a lot of people who totally got this inage</td>', 'Well I think you can feel hard done by with this shot, like you I love the melding of the feathers and the waves as well as the fact that is stands alone as an interesting image outside of the challenge Interesting Bell curve on the votes you got, nice to see that there were a lot of people who totally got this inage', '2008-03-21 12:35:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4578642, 657042, 68035, '<td valign="top">I love the fact that even though you cant see the childs face when you look at the picture you just know she is laughing and smiling<br/> <br/>I also like the fact that this has the feel of a natural blur rather than a trick of the camera<br/>Great sense of motion and a gorgeous soft B&amp;W conversion which really enhances the shot</td>', 'I love the fact that even though you cant see the childs face when you look at the picture you just know she is laughing and smiling I also like the fact that this has the feel of a natural blur rather than a trick of the cameraGreat sense of motion and a gorgeous soft B&W conversion which really enhances the shot', '2008-03-21 12:38:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4578654, 655018, 68035, '<td valign="top">Sandy, what a cool shot, I love the way you have created the musical notes in the air through camera movement and the fact that they are dancing above the heads of the people just adds to the sense of wonderment and fairytale<br/> <br/>The way you have still retained the colours of the umbrellas is cool and adds even more verve to the shot<br/> <br/>Let me tell you that score isnt too bad at all (well not for us mere mortals anyway) but I do think its great that this is a photo that you love and that voters opinions do not matter a jot</td>', 'Sandy, what a cool shot, I love the way you have created the musical notes in the air through camera movement and the fact that they are dancing above the heads of the people just adds to the sense of wonderment and fairytale The way you have still retained the colours of the umbrellas is cool and adds even more verve to the shot Let me tell you that score isnt too bad at all (well not for us mere mortals anyway) but I do think its great that this is a photo that you love and that voters opinions do not matter a jot', '2008-03-21 12:47:44.000000', NULL, 0),
