(4580356, 656998, 57886, '<td valign="top">Mér finnst þessi mynd tær snilld Gurrý.... Vírinn er algjörlega bara til að auka á spennu myndarinnar - fín í alla staði!!! en veistu að næsta keppni sem þú tekur þátt í verður sú eitthundraðasta þín?!</td>', 'Mér finnst þessi mynd tær snilld Gurrý.... Vírinn er algjörlega bara til að auka á spennu myndarinnar - fín í alla staði!!! en veistu að næsta keppni sem þú tekur þátt í verður sú eitthundraðasta þín?!', '2008-03-22 17:08:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4580863, 656469, 69008, '<td valign="top">This was a complex challenge to shoot for, and you found a colorful subject which added interest to the shot.  Good job.  You are doing very nicely  having been on DPC for only a month.</td>', 'This was a complex challenge to shoot for, and you found a colorful subject which added interest to the shot.  Good job.  You are doing very nicely  having been on DPC for only a month.', '2008-03-23 02:00:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4581195, 657063, 27763, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  Congrats on 4th place!</td>', 'Lovely.  Congrats on 4th place!', '2008-03-23 11:38:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4581197, 655721, 27763, '<td valign="top">I like it a lot!  Nicely seen, and nicely done.  Congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'I like it a lot!  Nicely seen, and nicely done.  Congrats on the ribbon!', '2008-03-23 11:40:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4581337, 656002, 50641, '<td valign="top">arrgh, 5.39?  Nuts.  Nice work!</td>', 'arrgh, 5.39?  Nuts.  Nice work!', '2008-03-23 13:17:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4581354, 657141, 50641, '<td valign="top">Nice going - great texture and comp - and blue was a good choice to offset the blur (dpc loves blue!).  Was an 8 from me during voting - I particularly liked the spookiness.  Congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'Nice going - great texture and comp - and blue was a good choice to offset the blur (dpc loves blue!).  Was an 8 from me during voting - I particularly liked the spookiness.  Congrats on the ribbon!', '2008-03-23 13:31:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4581378, 656490, 50641, '<td valign="top">Pigeon power!  Love the doves!  I found Paris pigeons to be much more swooopy and active than NYC pigeons - perhaps we have the American ''couch pigeon'' variety here - moderately obese, sedentary etc. Do Norwegian doves swoop or slouch?  Or are they as vertiginous as you portray them?  I love what this photo does to my eyeballs.  Nice work!</td>', 'Pigeon power!  Love the doves!  I found Paris pigeons to be much more swooopy and active than NYC pigeons - perhaps we have the American ''couch pigeon'' variety here - moderately obese, sedentary etc. Do Norwegian doves swoop or slouch?  Or are they as vertiginous as you portray them?  I love what this photo does to my eyeballs.  Nice work!', '2008-03-23 13:50:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4581382, 657046, 50641, '<td valign="top">I love purple with green and this is a very interesting abstract to boot!  For me it falls somewhere between Pink Floyd''s lightshows and Deep Space 9.  Excellent title too.</td>', 'I love purple with green and this is a very interesting abstract to boot!  For me it falls somewhere between Pink Floyd''s lightshows and Deep Space 9.  Excellent title too.', '2008-03-23 13:55:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4581385, 656860, 50641, '<td valign="top">Aaah that''s a nice histogram! You made a good subset of people feel something - which, IMO, is often more satisfying than making something so technically adept that voters can''t justify giving a low score.  I would be very happy if any of the scads of (unintentionally) blurry swan shots I''ve taken came out like this!  This looks <i>amazing</i> from a distance - truly impressionistic. Kudos!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-03-23 15:37:17.</i></td>', 'Aaah that''s a nice histogram! You made a good subset of people feel something - which, IMO, is often more satisfying than making something so technically adept that voters can''t justify giving a low score.  I would be very happy if any of the scads of (unintentionally) blurry swan shots I''ve taken came out like this!  This looks amazing from a distance - truly impressionistic. Kudos!', '2008-03-23 14:03:12.000000', '2008-03-23 15:37:17.000000', 0),
(4581391, 655842, 50641, '<td valign="top">Cool!  Looks like a frame from a Clorox commercial... one with magically exploding clothes-bursts and sparkly whooshes!  Punchy and vivid - also looks great as thumbnail. Nice going!</td>', 'Cool!  Looks like a frame from a Clorox commercial... one with magically exploding clothes-bursts and sparkly whooshes!  Punchy and vivid - also looks great as thumbnail. Nice going!', '2008-03-23 14:10:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4581398, 656625, 50641, '<td valign="top">I like the way the borders and edges have been lost to blur. The tv set is just another corridor. Is that a ''merkin flag in the foreground?  Re: hair?  Are you trying to triple your views ;-)</td>', 'I like the way the borders and edges have been lost to blur. The tv set is just another corridor. Is that a ''merkin flag in the foreground?  Re: hair?  Are you trying to triple your views ;-)', '2008-03-23 14:16:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4581412, 657085, 50641, '<td valign="top">Maybe beat him with a baseball bat then ;-)<br/> <br/>I love this fantastic mess you''ve made of our pets - and especially how the rug is almost indistinguishable from the fur.  Beautiful!</td>', 'Maybe beat him with a baseball bat then ;-) I love this fantastic mess you''ve made of our pets - and especially how the rug is almost indistinguishable from the fur.  Beautiful!', '2008-03-23 14:28:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4581420, 655811, 50641, '<td valign="top">Yes, agree with Kelli -  it is like spin art or sand art!  Love the perimeter especially. Great colors - 7 from me during voting.  Way to pimp up da rug!</td>', 'Yes, agree with Kelli -  it is like spin art or sand art!  Love the perimeter especially. Great colors - 7 from me during voting.  Way to pimp up da rug!', '2008-03-23 14:32:11.000000', NULL, 0),
