(4588235, 657042, 50695, '<td valign="top">I underrated this one. I underrated many pics in this challenge, because there was so much to love. In any other challenge this would have gotten high marks from me. I love how she disappears into geometric shapes.</td>', 'I underrated this one. I underrated many pics in this challenge, because there was so much to love. In any other challenge this would have gotten high marks from me. I love how she disappears into geometric shapes.', '2008-03-26 09:38:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4588844, 657141, 87374, '<td valign="top">Now THIS is the kind of unique photography I''d love to be doing.  Anyone can take a picture of a tree, but you''ve added a gorgeous twist to the everyday and I really appreciate your work.  Thanks so much for telling us how you did it.  I''m using a digital without interchangeable lenses or the ability to add filters, but your photo makes me want to go out and buy a better camera.  Thank you!</td>', 'Now THIS is the kind of unique photography I''d love to be doing.  Anyone can take a picture of a tree, but you''ve added a gorgeous twist to the everyday and I really appreciate your work.  Thanks so much for telling us how you did it.  I''m using a digital without interchangeable lenses or the ability to add filters, but your photo makes me want to go out and buy a better camera.  Thank you!', '2008-03-26 12:42:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4588854, 655721, 87374, '<td valign="top">This looks like a goregous impressionist rendition of a fine painting.  I am SO going to do this during the next big rain.  Love it!</td>', 'This looks like a goregous impressionist rendition of a fine painting.  I am SO going to do this during the next big rain.  Love it!', '2008-03-26 12:47:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4588867, 657130, 87374, '<td valign="top">Would love to know how long your shutter was open when you took this shot.  You have added such beauty and appreciation to my day with your beautiful photo.  Thank you.</td>', 'Would love to know how long your shutter was open when you took this shot.  You have added such beauty and appreciation to my day with your beautiful photo.  Thank you.', '2008-03-26 12:51:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4589050, 654845, 48697, '<td valign="top">This was a hard challenge and almost everyone scored low. It it is nature for us to want to see things in focus and sharp and while blur and soft focus and work, more often it doesn''t.  This has a nice abstrat feel but I don''t think the blur added anything to the shot, which is what people were looking for in this challenge. The color is nice and the compositon seems nice but as I stated the blur doesn''t make your subject anymore interesting, just blurry. I would have voted this a 5.</td>', 'This was a hard challenge and almost everyone scored low. It it is nature for us to want to see things in focus and sharp and while blur and soft focus and work, more often it doesn''t.  This has a nice abstrat feel but I don''t think the blur added anything to the shot, which is what people were looking for in this challenge. The color is nice and the compositon seems nice but as I stated the blur doesn''t make your subject anymore interesting, just blurry. I would have voted this a 5.', '2008-03-26 14:04:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4589163, 656166, 66201, '<td valign="top">Hey Joe,Congrats on this finish...</td>', 'Hey Joe,Congrats on this finish...', '2008-03-26 14:47:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4589183, 654845, 30982, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the blur necessarily added to this shot.  Blur is hard - for examples of how to do it well, see nshapiro''s portfolio.  His secret is color - very rich color - and smoothness.  Everything is smooth and blends well.  I''ve tried to emulate it and failed.  This is a bit more jagged than smooth, if that makes sense, and really needs some contrasting color as well.</td>', 'I don''t think the blur necessarily added to this shot.  Blur is hard - for examples of how to do it well, see nshapiro''s portfolio.  His secret is color - very rich color - and smoothness.  Everything is smooth and blends well.  I''ve tried to emulate it and failed.  This is a bit more jagged than smooth, if that makes sense, and really needs some contrasting color as well.', '2008-03-26 14:51:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4590058, 656148, 39638, '<td valign="top">dang -- that is cool</td>', 'dang -- that is cool', '2008-03-26 21:54:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4590953, 656075, 41206, '<td valign="top">Interesting! I also think using glass/mirrors works well and makes for a dirrent view of common events!</td>', 'Interesting! I also think using glass/mirrors works well and makes for a dirrent view of common events!', '2008-03-27 09:34:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4591157, 656358, 65319, '<td valign="top">What a perfect title for this fabulous entry!  Congrats on Top 20!!</td>', 'What a perfect title for this fabulous entry!  Congrats on Top 20!!', '2008-03-27 11:28:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4592020, 655980, 51793, '<td valign="top">Hey there again... Thought I would look around and some other things you have done. WOW 13 out of 290 awesome job. I thought for sure this challenges winner would have a zoomed blur but I guess not. I thought it was an excellent idea (psssst I did a zoom blur too) but you''re finished WAY ahead of mine. Again great work and congrats on such a wonderful finish.</td>', 'Hey there again... Thought I would look around and some other things you have done. WOW 13 out of 290 awesome job. I thought for sure this challenges winner would have a zoomed blur but I guess not. I thought it was an excellent idea (psssst I did a zoom blur too) but you''re finished WAY ahead of mine. Again great work and congrats on such a wonderful finish.', '2008-03-27 17:41:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4592058, 655980, 80904, '<td valign="top">Wow! this one screams at you. Great job</td>', 'Wow! this one screams at you. Great job', '2008-03-27 17:58:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4592060, 655980, 40718, '<td valign="top">Zoom blur is always interesting.  Nicely done getting a 6+ on this topic.</td>', 'Zoom blur is always interesting.  Nicely done getting a 6+ on this topic.', '2008-03-27 17:58:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4592092, 655980, 66524, '<td valign="top">I particularly liked visiting the blur challenge to see what people would come up with.  I avoided the challenge because I don''t need DPC "enabling" my natural faults :)<br/> <br/>Your photo represents a nice learning curve for me...learning manual mode! (hmm? just what were those settings?)<br/> <br/>I think I can try this and proudly say "I meant to do that!"</td>', 'I particularly liked visiting the blur challenge to see what people would come up with.  I avoided the challenge because I don''t need DPC "enabling" my natural faults :) Your photo represents a nice learning curve for me...learning manual mode! (hmm? just what were those settings?) I think I can try this and proudly say "I meant to do that!"', '2008-03-27 18:09:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4592098, 657141, 66524, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!<br/>As a learner I appreciate your notes<br/>CONGRATS!</td>', 'Nicely done!As a learner I appreciate your notesCONGRATS!', '2008-03-27 18:12:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4592338, 655980, 80608, '<td valign="top">very interesting zoom effect</td>', 'very interesting zoom effect', '2008-03-27 20:22:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4592425, 655980, 82749, '<td valign="top">Love the streaky colors in the upper/right half of the image.  Like the way you got this to be nice and blurry yet still maintained the integrity of the scene.</td>', 'Love the streaky colors in the upper/right half of the image.  Like the way you got this to be nice and blurry yet still maintained the integrity of the scene.', '2008-03-27 20:56:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4592916, 657042, 30982, '<td valign="top">The way this is exposed and blurred lets her fly completely free, with no strings (or swings) attached.</td>', 'The way this is exposed and blurred lets her fly completely free, with no strings (or swings) attached.', '2008-03-28 03:40:02.000000', NULL, 0),
